6"},"nl":{"name":"Laser Games en Escape Games - Groepsspelen 150% Fun","shortdescr":"Een ideale plek om plezier te maken met familie, vrienden en collega's.\r\nVoor een verjaardagsfeestje, een uitje met vrienden, een bedrijfsfeest, teambuilding en toekomstige echtgenoten","longdescr":"- Ruimte Plezier Games = Ruimte Lasergames + Ruimte Team Games\r\n\r\n- 1000m2 indoor team games gegarandeerd 150% plezier en toegankelijk voor iedereen vanaf 7 jaar\r\n\r\n- De grootste lasergames in Brussel met een ruimtelijk decor & 11 mini escape games met behendigheids-, sport- en intellectuele spelen\r\n\r\n- 7 dagen per week geopend, flexibele uren, concurrerende prijzen, dicht bij openbaar vervoer en gratis parkeren.\r\n\r\nJe zult vertrekken met je hoofd in de sterren.","performers":"De Team van Space Fun Games","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"info@spacefungames.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.535886"},"en":{"name":"Laser Games and Escape Games - Group games 150% Fun","shortdescr":"An ideal place to have fun with family, friends and colleagues.\r\nFor a birthday party, a company party, Team Building and EVG & EVJF.","longdescr":"- Space Fun Games = Space Laser Games + Space Team Games\r\n\r\n- 1000m2 of indoor team games guaranteed 150% Fun and accessible to all from 7 years old \r\n\r\n- The biggest laser games in Brussels with a spatial decor & 11 mini escape games with agility, sports and intellectual games\r\n\r\n- Open 7 days a week, flexible hours, competitive prices, close to public transport and free parking.\r\n\r\nYou will leave with your head in the stars.","performers":"The Team of Space Fun Games","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"info@spacefungames.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.535886"},"de":{"name":"Laser Games et Escape Games","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":nu