 12-15 ans","Jeunes 15-18 ans","Famille","Seniors"],"nl":["Kinderen 9-12 j.","Jongeren 12-15 j.","Jongeren 15-18 j.","Familie","Senioren"],"en":["Children 9-12 yr.","Youth 12-15  yr.","Youth 15-18  yr.","Family","Seniors"]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":{"list":[259,266],"translations":{"fr":["Chien d'assistance","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"nl":["Assistentiehonden","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Assistance dogs","Brussels Health Safety Label"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-09-12T01:35:48+02:00","published_at":"2022-06-14T09:17:19+02:00","backoffice_id":255910,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.37152535931969},{"id":532348,"date_start":"2022-08-03","date_end":"2022-09-25","date_next":"2022-09-13","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[36,46],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Pluridisciplinaire"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Multidisciplinair"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Multidisciplinary"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Les Y\u00e9zidis et le Y\u00e9zidisme","shortdescr":"Lors de cette exposition au MMM, vous pourrez en apprendre davantage sur les Y\u00e9zidis et le Y\u00e9zidisme \u00e0 travers des photos, des v\u00eatements traditionnels, l\u2019Ange Paon, des maquettes du temple Lalisha Nurani, des t\u00e9moignages, des interviews de Yezidis \u00e0 Bruxelles et des faits historiques.","longdescr":"Il y a 1 million de Y\u00e9zidis, r\u00e9partis dans le monde entier, parfois dans des pays o\u00f9 ils ne peuvent maintenir leur langue, leur religion et leur culture. Les Y\u00e9zidis bas\u00e9s \u00e0 Bruxelles sont principalement originaires de l\u2019ancienne Union sovi\u00e9tique, notamment de G\u00e9orgie, o\u00f9 ils ont fui la Turquie. Les plumes de la queue du paon sont consid\u00e9r\u00e9es aujourd\u2019hui par de nombreux Yezidis comme repr\u00e9sentant les nombreux peuples.\r\n\r\nLors de cette exposition au MMM, vous pourrez en apprendre davantage sur les Y\u00e9zidis et le Y\u00e9zidisme \u00e0 travers des photos, des v\u00eatements traditionnels, l\u2019Ange Paon, des maquettes du temple Lalisha Nurani, des t\u00e9moignages, des interviews de Yezidis \u00e0 Bruxelles et des faits historiques.\r\nLe premier jour de l\u2019exposition a lieu lors de la comm\u00e9moration annuelle de la campagne g\u00e9nocidaire contre la minorit\u00e9 y\u00e9zidie en 2014.\r\n\r\nCette expo est une collaboration avec La Maison Des Yezidis.\r\n\r\nLe vernissage de l\u2019exposition aura lieu au mus\u00e9e le mardi 02\/08.\r\nR\u00e9servation via museum@foyer.be \/ +32 2 609 55 61.","performers":"Cette expo est une collaboration avec La Maison Des Yezidis.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","email":"museum@foyer.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532348"},"nl":{"name":"Jezidi\u2019s en Jezidisme","shortdescr":"Tijdens deze expo in het MMM kunt u meer te weten komen over Jezidi\u2019s en Jezidisme, aan de hand van foto\u2019s, traditionele kleding, de Pauwengel, maquettes van de tempel Lalisha Nurani, getuigenissen, interviews met Jezidi\u2019s in Brussel en historische feiten.","longdescr":"Er zijn 1 miljoen Jezidi\u2019s, verspreid over de wereld, soms in landen waar ze hun taal, religie en cultuur niet kunnen onderhouden. De Brusselse Jezidi\u2019s komen vooral uit de voormalige Sovjet-Unie, o.a. uit Georgi\u00eb, waarnaar ze ooit gevlucht zijn vanuit Turkije. De veren van de pauwenstaart worden vandaag door veel Jezidi\u2019s gezien als staande voor de vele volkeren.\r\n\r\nTijdens deze expo in het MMM kunt u meer te weten komen over Jezidi\u2019s en Jezidisme, aan de hand van foto\u2019s, traditionele kleding, de Pauwengel, maquettes van de tempel Lalisha Nurani, getuigenissen, interviews met Jezidi\u2019s in Brussel en historische feiten.\r\nDe eerste dag van de expo valt op de jaarlijkse herdenking van de genocidale campagne tegen de Jezidi-minderheid in 2014.\r\n\r\nDeze expo is een samenwerking met La Maison Des Yezidis.\r\n\r\nDe opening van de expo vindt plaats in het museum op dinsdag 02\/08.\r\nReserveren via museum@foyer.be \/ +32 2 609 55 61.","performers":"Deze expo is een samenwerking met La Maison Des Yezidis.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 609 55 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532348"},"en":{"name":"Yezidis and Yezidism","shortdescr":"During this exhibition at the MMM, you can learn more about Yezidis and Yezidism through photos, traditional clothing, the Peacock Angel, maquettes of the Lalisha Nurani temple, testimonies, interviews with Yezidis in Brussels and historical facts.","longdescr":"There are 1 million Yezidis, spread all over the world, sometimes in countries where they cannot maintain their language, religion and culture. The Brussels-based Yezidis come mainly from the former Soviet Union, including Georgia, to which they once fled from Turkey. The feathers of the peacock\u2019s tail are seen today by many Yezidis as standing for the many peoples.\r\n\r\nDuring this exhibition at the MMM, you can learn more about Yezidis and Yezidism through photos, traditional clothing, the Peacock Angel, maquettes of the Lalisha Nurani temple, testimonies, interviews with Yezidis in Brussels and historical facts.\r\nThe first day of the exhibition falls on the annual commemoration of the genocidal campaign against the Yezidi minority in 2014.\r\n\r\nThis expo is a collaboration with La Maison Des Yezidis.\r\n\r\nThe opening of the exhibition will take place in the museum on Tuesday 02\/08.\r\nReservation via museum@foyer.be \/ +32 2 609 55 61.","performers":"This expo is a collaboration with La Maison Des Yezidis.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532348"},"de":{"name":"Jezidi\u2019s en Jezidisme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532348"},"it":{"name":"Jezidi\u2019s en Jezidisme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532348"},"sp":{"name":"Jezidi\u2019s en Jezidisme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532348"},"pt":{"name":"Jezidi\u2019s en Jezidisme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532348"},"cn":{"name":"Jezidi\u2019s en Jezidisme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532348"}},"place":{"id":274307,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MigratieMuseumMigration","address_street_name":"rue des ateliers","address_street_number":"17","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@foyer.be","website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue des ateliers, 17","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Aujourd'hui, plus de 180 nationalite\u0301s vivent ensemble a\u0300 Bruxelles. Le MigratieMuseumMigration raconte l\u2019histoire de la premie\u0300re ge\u0301ne\u0301ration de travailleurs immigre\u0301s invite\u0301s, des premiers arrivants au Petit Cha\u0302teau, des expatrie\u0301s, des re\u0301fugie\u0301s de guerre, des Europe\u0301ens qui se sont de\u0301place\u0301s librement au sein de l\u2019UE et de tous les autres. C\u2019est un muse\u0301e chaleureux ou\u0300 les visiteurs peuvent de\u0301couvrir la ville et la vie des autres a\u0300 travers des souvenirs, mais aussi, et avant tout, un lieu accueillant pour y partager sa propre histoire.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"MigratieMuseumMigration","address_street_name":"Werkhuizenstraat","address_street_number":"17","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@foyer.be","website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","address_line1":"Werkhuizenstraat, 17","address_line2":"1080 Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","description_web":"Vandaag de dag wonen meer dan 180 nationaliteiten samen in Brussel. Het MigratieMuseumMigration geeft de verhalen van de eerste generatiegastarbeiders, van de vroegste bewoners van het Klein Kasteeltje, van de expats, de oorlogsvluchtelingen, de Europeanen die zich vrij bewegen binnen de EU en vele anderen een permanente thuis. Het is een warme omgeving waar bezoekers via herinneringen en kunst op ontdekking gaan in Brussel en in het leven van anderen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MigratieMuseumMigration","address_street_name":"rue des ateliers","address_street_number":"17","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@foyer.be","website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue des ateliers, 17","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Today, more than 180 nationalities live together in Brussels. The MigratieMuseumMigration gives a permanent home to the stories of the first generation of guest workers, of the earliest inhabitants of the Petit-Cha\u0302teau, of the expats, the war refugees, the Europeans who move freely within the EU and many others. It is a warm environment where visitors can discover Brussels and the lives of others through memories and souvenirs. Above all, it is a museum with plenty of room to share your own story.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MigratieMuseumMigration","address_street_name":"rue des ateliers","address_street_number":"17","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@foyer.be","website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue des ateliers, 17","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MigratieMuseumMigration","address_street_name":"rue des ateliers","address_street_number":"17","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@foyer.be","website":"http:\/\/www.migratiemuseummigration.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 609 55 61","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue des ateliers, 17","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"","description_p