":{"fr":"Ouvert les premier, deuxi\u00e8me, troisi\u00e8me, quatri\u00e8me et dernier vendredis du mois de 20:00 \u00e0 22:45","nl":"Open op de eerste, tweede, derde, vierde en laatste vrijdags van de maand van 20:00 tot 22:45","en":"Open the first, second, third, fourth and last fridays of the month from 20:00 to 22:45"}},{"day":"saturday","occurences":{"is_first":true,"is_second":true,"is_third":true,"is_fourth":true,"is_last":true},"time_start":"12:00:00","time_end":"14:15:00","translations":{"fr":"Ouvert les premier, deuxi\u00e8me, troisi\u00e8me, quatri\u00e8me et dernier samedis du mois de 12:00 \u00e0 14:15","nl":"Open op de eerste, tweede, derde, vierde en laatste zaterdags van de maand van 12:00 tot 14:15","en":"Open the first, second, third, fourth and last saturdays of the month from 12:00 to 14:15"}},{"day":"saturday","occurences":{"is_first":true,"is_second":true,"is_third":true,"is_fourth":true,"is_last":true},"time_start":"20:00:00","time_end":"22:45:00","translations":{"fr":"Ouvert les premier, deuxi\u00e8me, troisi\u00e8me, quatri\u00e8me et dernier samedis du mois de 20:00 \u00e0 22:45","nl":"Open op de eerste, tweede, derde, vierde en laatste zaterdags van de maand van 20:00 tot 22:45","en":"Open the first, second, third, fourth and last saturdays of the month from 20:00 to 22:45"}},{"day":"sunday","occurences":{"is_first":true,"is_second":true,"is_third":true,"is_fourth":true,"is_last":true},"time_start":"19:00:00","time_end":"21:15:00","translations":{"fr":"Ouvert les premier, deuxi\u00e8me, troisi\u00e8me, quatri\u00e8me et dernier dimanches du mois de 19:00 \u00e0 21:15","nl":"Open op de eerste, tweede, derde, vierde en laatste zondags van de maand van 19:00 tot 21:15","en":"Open the first, second, third, fourth and last sundays of the month from 19:00 to 21:15"}}],"closing_days":["2022-07-03","2022-07-04","2022-07-05","2022-07-06","2022-07-07","2022-07-08","2022-07-09","2022-07-10","2022-07-11","2022-07-12","2022-07-13","2022-07-14","2022-07-15","2022-07-16","2022-07-17","2022-07-18","2022-07-19","2022-07-20","2022-07-21","2022-07-22","2022-07-23","2022-07-24","2022-07-25","2022-07-26","2022-07-27","2022-07-28","2022-07-29","2022-07-30","2022-07-31","2022-08-01","2022-08-02","2022-08-03","2022-08-04","2022-08-05","2022-08-06","2022-08-07","2022-08-08","2022-08-09","2022-08-10","2022-08-11","2022-08-12","2022-08-13","2022-08-14","2022-08-15","2022-08-16","2022-08-17","2022-08-18","2022-08-19","2022-08-20","2022-08-21","2022-08-22","2022-08-23","2022-08-24","2022-08-25","2022-08-26","2022-08-27","2022-08-28","2022-08-29","2022-08-30","2022-08-31","2022-09-01","2022-09-02"],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cat\u00e9gorie 1"},"nl":{"name":"Categorie 1"},"en":{"name":"Category 1"}},"value":105},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cat\u00e9gorie 2"},"nl":{"name":"Categorie 2"},"en":{"name":"Category 2"}},"value":130}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["exterior"],"accessibilities":{"list":[266],"translations":{"fr":["Brussels Health Safety Label"],"nl":["Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Brussels Health Safety Label"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-09-12T01:05:43+02:00","published_at":"2022-04-07T14:02:59+02:00","backoffice_id":251124,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.096961157376676},{"id":536405,"date_start":"2022-09-14","date_end":"2022-09-14","date_next":"2022-09-14","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[4,7],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Under The Reefs Orchestra - Catherine Graindorge","shortdescr":"L'enivrant trio instrumental aux fronti\u00e8res du jazz et du rock alternatif","longdescr":"Under The Reefs Orchestra est un power trio instrumental \u00e9voluant aux fronti\u00e8res du jazz et du rock alternatif. Cl\u00e9ment Nourry, guitariste, compositeur et proche collaborateur de Yoka\u00ef et Nicolas Michaux, y est entour\u00e9 du saxophoniste Marti Meli\u00e0 (Flat Earth Society) et du batteur Jakob Warmenbol (Don Kapot) D\u2019une grande libert\u00e9 stylistique, la musique d\u2019Under The Reefs Orchestra \u00e9pouse des structures m\u00e9lodiques famili\u00e8res et invite l\u2019auditeur dans un paysage hant\u00e9 et unique. Le groupe fa\u00e7onne un soundtrack parcouru par les spectres de Moondog et Adrien Belew. Entre v\u00e9rit\u00e9 immuable et vertige de l\u2019inconnu, Under The Reefs Orchestra offre la bande-son parfaite de l\u2019apocalypse \u00e9cologique qui semble avoir commenc\u00e9.\r\n\r\nCATHERINE GRAINDORGE\r\nDepuis 2012 et la sortie de son premier album solo, la violoniste et compositrice bruxelloise a multipli\u00e9 les collaborations avec des artistes tels que John Parish, Hugo Race, Pascal Humbert et Bertrand Cantat (D\u00e9troit), Warren Ellis, Mark Lannegan et Nick Cave (Jeffrey Lee Pierce Project) mais \u00e9galement compos\u00e9 pour la danse, le th\u00e9\u00e2tre et le cin\u00e9ma (avec une nomination aux Magritte pour sa bande originale du \u00ab Chant des Hommes \u00bb).\r\nEn octobre 2021, elle sort un deuxi\u00e8me album solo enregistr\u00e9 \u00e0 Bristol aux c\u00f4t\u00e9s du l\u00e9gendaire John Parish, ici producteur mais \u00e9galement musicien, sur le label Tak :Til (Glitterbeat). En \u00e9cho lointain aux envol\u00e9es cin\u00e9matographiques d'un Max Richter ou aux harmonies \u00e9corch\u00e9es d'un Warren Ellis, Catherine y poursuit son voyage hors du temps, unique en son genre. En d\u00e9cembre 2021 commence une collaboration \u00e0 distance avec Iggy Pop. De leurs \u00e9changes naitra le EP The Dictator qui sortira le 9 septembre sur Glitterbeat.","performers":"Under The Reefs Orchestra,  Catherine Graindorge","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","email":"info@botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 37 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536405"},"nl":{"name":"Under The Reefs Orchestra - Catherine Graindorge","shortdescr":"Instrumentaal jazz-rocktrio maakt de soundtrack van de ecologische apocalyps","longdescr":"Under The Reefs Orchestra is een instrumentaal power trio dat foerageert tussen jazz en alternatieve rock. De frontman ervan is Cl\u00e9ment Nourry, een graag geziene man in de Brusselse scene die vaak samenwerkt met Y\u00f4ka\u00ef en Nicolas Michaux. In UTRO wordt hij vergezeld door Marti Melia (Flat Earth Society) en Louis Evrard (Robbing Millions, Ottla). De groep kwam tot stand in het kader van Les Nuits 2017 en groeide uit tot een vastewaarde binnen de vaderlandse scene. Muzikaal gezien brengt het drietal een treffende soundtrack voor de ecologische apocalyps die zich aan het ontwikkelen is.\r\n\r\nSinds ze in 2012 een eerste soloalbum uitbracht, mocht de Brusselse violiste Catherine Graindorge al samenwerken met enkele groten der aarde, of wacht dat je van John Parish (PJ Harvey's producer), Hugo Race, Pascal Humbert en Bertrand Cantat (D\u00e9troit) en Warren Ellis en Nick Cave (Jeffrey Lee Pierce Project). Daarnaast werkte ze aan projecten uit de dans-, theater- en filmwereld; de soundtrack voor 'Chant des Hommes' werd zelfs genomineerd voor een Magritte. Haar meest recente album 'Eldorado', opgenomen met John Parish, verscheen via Glitterbeat\/Tak:Til en doet denken aan de filmische stijl van Max Richter en de harmonie\u00ebn van Warren Ellis.","performers":"Under The Reefs Orchestra,  Catherine Graindorge","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/botanique.be\/fr\/concert\/under-reefs-orchestra-catherine-graindorge-2022","email":"info@botanique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536405"},"en":{"name":"Under The Reefs Orchestra - Catherine Graindorge","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"A sonic-minded power trio of obsessive, biting riffs and mists of asymmetrical sonic cycles. Inspired as much by French chamber music of the 19th century as by Jim O\u2019Rourke or Moondog, Under The Reefs Orchestra\u2019s hypnotic music unleashes a cosmic energy and leads the listener to a trance among underwater volcanos.Guitarist Clement Nourry\u2019s gentlemanly demeanor masks the great fiery passion of a true musical virtuoso. \u201cI focus on one thing, and one thing entirely\u201d says Nourry. For him, that one thing is the guitar. Combining the deep theoretically understanding of a skilled mathematician (which he actually is) with a true musician\u2019s soulful instinct, Nourry is as comfortable with John Fahey as he is with experimental jazz. To put it simply: he shreds. This trip through the timeless realms of sound can be heard as a soundtrack of the ecological apocalypse we live in.","performers":"Under The Reefs Orchestra,  Catherine Graindorge","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536405"},"de":{"name":"Unde The Reefs Orchestra","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536405"},"it":{"name":"Unde The Reefs Orchestra","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536405"},"sp":{"name":"Unde The Reefs Orchestra","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536405"},"pt":{"name":"Unde The Reefs Orchestra","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536405"},"cn":{"name":"Unde The Reefs Orchestra","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536405"}},"place":{"id":11,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"L\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gant Centre Culturel de la Communaut\u00e9 fran\u00e7aise est joliment situ\u00e9 dans les anciens jardins botaniques pr\u00e8s de la petite ceinture de Bruxelles. Vous pouvez assister \u00e0 des concerts dans les espaces intimes \u00e0 l\u2019ambiance chaleureuse, dont  les plus connus sont l\u2019Orangerie, la Rotonde, le Mus\u00e9e et le Witloof Bar. \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Koningsstraat","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Koningsstraat, 236","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"In de voormalige botanische tuinen aan de kleine ring, thans het klassevolle cultuurcentrum van de Franse Gemeenschap, is het goed toeven. Concerten vinden er plaats op een unieke locatie, in sfeervolle en intieme ruimtes. De kwalitatieve eclectische programmatie staat zeer open voor nieuwe trends.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"The former botanical gardens provide the unique location for the stylish cultural centre of the French community and are a great place to relax. Concerts are held in the intimate surroundings of its eight spaces and multipurpose halls, of which the most famous are the Orangerie, the Rotonde, the Museum, and the Witloof Bar.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Le Botanique z\u00e4hlt ohne Zweifel zu den sch\u00f6nsten und spektakul\u00e4rsten Veranstaltungsorten Br\u00fcssels. Das von 1826 bis 1829 von der \u201eSoci\u00e9t\u00e9 Royale d'Horticulture\u201c erbaute, ehemalige Gew\u00e4chshaus im neoklassizistischen Stil mit Eisen- und Glasarchitektur beherbergt seit 1984 einen hochkar\u00e4tigen Veranstaltungsort.\r\n\r\nInmitten des botanischen Gartens von Saint-Josse-ten-Noode, einer der 19 Br\u00fcsseler Gemeinden, w\u00e4chst und gedeiht heute ein quicklebendiger Ort der Kultur, der vor allem f\u00fcr Musikveranstaltungen, als Galerie und Caf\u00e9 genutzt wird. H\u00f6hepunkt des Jahres bildet im Fr\u00fchling das Musikfestival \u201eLes Nuits Botaniques\".","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Questo grande edificio, che doveva ospitare le collezioni di un precedente giardino botanico, \u00e8 stato costruito fra il 1826 ed il 1829. L'artista-arredatore Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste diresse i lavori secondo progetto dell'architetto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Rispettando la struttura tradizionale degli aranceti, ha immaginato un'imponente cupola rotonda centrale, affiancata da due ali ciascuna delle quali terminante in un padiglione leggermente sporgente. Grazie alla sua regolarit\u00e0 e semplicit\u00e0, la costruzione illustra perfettamente i principi dello stile neoclassico. Alle vetrate che riempiono gli spazi tra le colonne della sala circolare e che coprono il portico delimitato dal colonnato stesso, si aggiungono le serre adiacenti alle ali laterali. Inizialmente si era pensato di organizzare feste all'interno di questo ambiente magico, e a questo scopo venne allestita una grande sala fra l'aranceto orientale e la sala rotonda, ma questa diventer\u00e0 poi la sala degli erbari dal 1870. Fino al 1939, l'edificio verr\u00e0 utilizzato per il suo scopo originale. Riacquistato dallo Stato nel 1970, il locale diventer\u00e0 il Centro Culturale della Federazione Vallonia-Bruxelles e verr\u00e0 inaugurato come tale nel 1984. Oggi ospita numerosi eventi culturali dedicati all'arte contemporanea e vi si svolgono festival, tra i quali il famoso Nuits du Botanique, che hanno contribuito ad affermare la sua reputazione. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Este enorme edificio, pensado para albergar las colecciones de un antiguo jard\u00edn bot\u00e1nico, fue construido entre 1826 y 1829. El artista-decorador Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste dirigi\u00f3 las obras a partir de los planos del arquitecto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Respetando la estructura tradicional de los invernaderos de naranjas, imagin\u00f3 una imponente rotonda central con c\u00fapula flanqueada por dos pasillos que terminaban en un pabell\u00f3n ligeramente en relieve. Gracias a su regularidad y simplicidad, la elevaci\u00f3n ilustra a la perfecci\u00f3n los principios del estilo neocl\u00e1sico. Las vidrieras situadas en los intercolumnios de la rotonda y que cubren el p\u00f3rtico delimitado por esta misma columnata se suman a los invernaderos adosados a los pasillos laterales. Pronto se pens\u00f3 en organizar fiestas en este lugar m\u00e1gico, para lo cual se acondicion\u00f3 una sala entre el invernadero de naranjas oriental y la rotonda, pero a partir de 1870 se convirti\u00f3 en la sala de los herbarios. Hasta 1939 cumpli\u00f3 las funciones teniendo en cuenta su vocaci\u00f3n inicial. Recomprado por el Estado en 1970, el lugar se convirti\u00f3 en el centro cultural de la Federaci\u00f3n Valonia-Bruselas y se inaugur\u00f3 como tal en 1984. A d\u00eda de hoy este lugar alberga numerosas manifestaciones culturales dedicadas a la creaci\u00f3n contempor\u00e1nea y se ha vuelto prestigioso por los festivales que se celebran en \u00e9l, tales como las \u00abNoches del bot\u00e1nico\u00bb. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[15],"translations":{"fr":["Rogier"],"nl":["Rogier"],"en":["Rogier"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"fr":["Nord"],"nl":["Noord"],"en":["North"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":5,"location":{"lat":50.85461438,"lon":4.36620044},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-08-26T13:05:12+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":11,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"L\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gant Centre Culturel de la Communaut\u00e9 fran\u00e7aise est joliment situ\u00e9 dans les anciens jardins botaniques pr\u00e8s de la petite ceinture de Bruxelles. Vous pouvez assister \u00e0 des concerts dans les espaces intimes \u00e0 l\u2019ambiance chaleureuse, dont  les plus connus sont l\u2019Orangerie, la Rotonde, le Mus\u00e9e et le Witloof Bar. \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Koningsstraat","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Koningsstraat, 236","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"In de voormalige botanische tuinen aan de kleine ring, thans het klassevolle cultuurcentrum van de Franse Gemeenschap, is het goed toeven. Concerten vinden er plaats op een unieke locatie, in sfeervolle en intieme ruimtes. De kwalitatieve eclectische programmatie staat zeer open voor nieuwe trends.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"The former botanical gardens provide the unique location for the stylish cultural centre of the French community and are a great place to relax. Concerts are held in the intimate surroundings of its eight spaces and multipurpose halls, of which the most famous are the Orangerie, the Rotonde, the Museum, and the Witloof Bar.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Le Botanique z\u00e4hlt ohne Zweifel zu den sch\u00f6nsten und spektakul\u00e4rsten Veranstaltungsorten Br\u00fcssels. Das von 1826 bis 1829 von der \u201eSoci\u00e9t\u00e9 Royale d'Horticulture\u201c erbaute, ehemalige Gew\u00e4chshaus im neoklassizistischen Stil mit Eisen- und Glasarchitektur beherbergt seit 1984 einen hochkar\u00e4tigen Veranstaltungsort.\r\n\r\nInmitten des botanischen Gartens von Saint-Josse-ten-Noode, einer der 19 Br\u00fcsseler Gemeinden, w\u00e4chst und gedeiht heute ein quicklebendiger Ort der Kultur, der vor allem f\u00fcr Musikveranstaltungen, als Galerie und Caf\u00e9 genutzt wird. H\u00f6hepunkt des Jahres bildet im Fr\u00fchling das Musikfestival \u201eLes Nuits Botaniques\".","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"R