nement international qui met \u00e0 l\u2019honneur le sport f\u00e9minin, un village sportif animera la place De Brouck\u00e8re de 10h \u00e0 18h. De nombreuses activit\u00e9s gratuites et ouvertes \u00e0 tout.e.s vous attendent : \r\n- 10h00 \u00e0 17h00 : activit\u00e9s sportives en continu\r\n- 12h30 \u00e0 13h30 : cours de danse avec Jeny Bonsenge\r\n- 14h00 : course de 4 km dans les rues de la capitale. En y participant, un T-Shirt vous sera offert aux couleurs de l'\u00e9v\u00e9nement. Il vous suffira de vous rendre au stand info (\u00e0 gauche de l\u2019entr\u00e9e du village) jusqu'\u00e0 13h30.\r\n- 16h00 \u00e0 17h00 : cours de danse avec Jeny Bonsenge\r\n- 17h00 : remise de prix\r\n- 17h30 \u00e0 18h00 : DJ set","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/events.isfsports.org\/fr\/she-runs-agl-fr\/","email":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 318 64 70","phone_booking":"+32 2 318 64 70","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541452"},"nl":{"name":"She Runs - sportdorp","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Op woensdag 14 september wordt in het kader van She Runs, het internationale evenement die de vrouwensport in de schijnwerpers zet, van 10 tot 18 uur een sportdorp ingericht op het De Brouck\u00e8replein. Er staan u tal van gratis activiteiten te wachten die voor iedereen toegankelijk zijn: \r\n- van 10 tot 17 uur: doorlopende sportactiviteiten\r\n- 12.30 tot 13.30: dansles met Jeny Bonsenge\r\n- 14.00 uur: 4 km wedstrijd in de straten van de hoofdstad. Als u meedoet, krijgt u een T-shirt in de kleuren van het evenement. U hoeft alleen maar tot 13.30 uur naar de informatiestand te gaan (links van de ingang van het dorp).\r\n- 16:00 tot 17:00: dansles met Jeny Bonsenge\r\n- 17.00 uur: prijsuitreiking\r\n- 17.30 tot 18.00: DJ-set","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541452"},"en":{"name":"She Runs - sports village","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"On Wednesday, September 14th, as part of She Runs, the international event that honors women's sports, a sports village will animate the place de Brouck\u00e8re from 10 am to 6 pm. Numerous free activities open to all await you: \r\n- 10:00 am to 5:00 pm: continuous sports activities\r\n- 12:30 to 13:30 : dance class with Jeny Bonsenge\r\n- 2:00 pm : 4 km race in the streets of the capital. By participating, a T-Shirt will be offered to you with the colors of the event. All you have to do is go to the info booth until 1:30 pm (on the left of the village entrance).\r\n- 16h00 to 17h00 : dance class with Jeny Bonsenge\r\n- 5:00 pm : prize giving\r\n- 5:30 pm to 6 pm: DJ set","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541452"},"de":{"name":"She Runs - Village sportif","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541452"},"it":{"name":"She Runs - Village sportif","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541452"},"sp":{"name":"She Runs - Village sportif","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541452"},"pt":{"name":"She Runs - Village sportif","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/a