ations":{"fr":"Sport","nl":"Sport","en":"Sport"}},"others":{"list":[159,167],"translations":{"fr":["Activit\u00e9 sportive","Sport traditionnel"],"nl":["Sportieve activiteit","Volkssporten"],"en":["Sporting activity","Traditional sport"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte Touch Rugby mixte","shortdescr":"S\u00e9ance d\u00e9couverte le 14 septembre ! Venez d\u00e9couvrir le Touch Rugby en \u00e9quipe mixte au stade des 3 Tilleuls \u00e0 Boitsfort, \u00e0 partir de 19h30","longdescr":"S\u00e9ance d\u00e9couverte le 14 septembre ! Venez d\u00e9couvrir le Touch Rugby en \u00e9quipe mixte au stade des 3 Tilleuls \u00e0 Boitsfort, \u00e0 partir de 19h30\r\n____\r\nQu\u2019est-ce que le Touch Rugby ?\r\n\r\nLe touch est un sport de la famille du rugby, originaire d\u2019Australie. C\u2019est un sport sans contact, ouvert \u00e0 tous, homme ou femme.\r\n\r\nLes joueurs stoppent la progression de l'\u00e9quipe adverse par un simple touch\u00e9 de la main. Il n'y a donc pas de plaquage, et il est obligatoire que les touch\u00e9s soient effectu\u00e9s de mani\u00e8re non violente. Chaque \u00e9quipe dispose de 6 touch\u00e9s pour marquer un essai. Lorsque le 6e touch\u00e9 est effectu\u00e9, le ballon est rendu \u00e0 l'\u00e9quipe adverse qui dispose alors \u00e0 son tour de 6 touch\u00e9s.\r\nChaque \u00e9quipe a 6 joueurs sur le terrain, plus des rempla\u00e7ants.\r\nLe Touch Rugby se joue sur un terrain un peu plus petit qu'un terrain de rugby classique. La partie dure 2 x 20 minutes\r\n\r\nLe Touch Rugby est un sport en d\u00e9veloppement en Belgique. Les \u00e9quipes belges (clubs et s\u00e9lections nationales) participent \u00e0 de nombreux tournois aussi bien en Belgique qu'\u00e0 l'\u00e9tranger\r\n____________________\r\nContact :\r\nmail : touch@brclub.org\r\nFB : BRCTOUCH\r\ninsta : brc_touch","performers":"Encadrement par les entraineurs de l'\u00e9quipe de Touch Rugby du Boitsfort Rugby Club","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.brclub.org\/?oid=736&pid=7481","email":"touch@brclub.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541372"},"nl":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte Touch Rugby mixte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"touch@brclub.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541372"},"en":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte Touch Rugby mixte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"touch@brclub.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541372"},"de":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte Touch Rugby mixte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541372"},"it":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte Touch Rugby mixte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541372"},"sp":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte Touch Rugby mixte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541372"},"pt":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte Touch Rugby mixte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541372"},"cn":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte Touch Rugby mixte","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"perform