s nos rues, nos quartiers, nos villes et nos paysages. \r\n\r\n> Ouvert tous les mercredis et samedis, de 14h \u00e0 19h.  \r\n> Visites guid\u00e9es: mercredi \u00e0 17h30 \/ samedi \u00e0 14h30 \r\n\r\nAvenue Pacheco 34, 1000 Bruxelles, 1er \u00e9tage","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540681"},"nl":{"name":"PREFIGURATIONS: een tentoonstelling over Architectuur en Transities","shortdescr":"Veertig architecturale projecten, geworven via een open projectoproep, zetten de toon voor een transitie naar een duurzame en sociale leefomgeving en een hernieuwde beschouwing van de architectuurpraktijk.","longdescr":"De Grote Verbouwing 2020-2030 heeft deze zomer de tentoonstelling PREFIGURATIONS gelanceerd, die opnieuw open is tot 23 oktober 2022. De tentoonstelling toont een veertigtal architectuurprojecten die de kiem leggen voor noodzakelijke sociale en ruimtelijke transities die zich vertalen naar verschillende Toekomstplekken in onze straten, wijken, steden en landschappen.\r\n\r\n> Elke woensdag en zaterdag, 14u-19u - gratis te bezoeken\r\n> Rondleidingen: woensdag 17:30u \/ zaterdag 14:30u\r\n\r\nPachecolaan 34, 1000 Brussel, verdieping 1","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/degroteverbouwing.eu\/nl\/agenda\/tentoonstelling+prefigurations\/","email":"info@degroteverbouwing.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540681"},"en":{"name":"PREFIGURATIONS: een tentoonstelling over Architectuur en Transities","shortdescr":"Forty architectural projects, that were selected after an open call, set the tone for transitions to a sustainable and social living environment and invite you to reconsider the architectural practice.","longdescr":"The Great Transformation 2020-2030 has launched the exhibition PREFIGURATIONS, which will be recontinued until 23 October 2022. The exhibition entails forty architectural projects, disclosing the seeds for the necessary social and spatial transition which can be translated in different Future Places in our streets, neighbourhoods, cities, and landscapes. \r\n\r\n> Open every Wednesday & Saturday, 2pm-7pm \r\n> Guided tours: Wednesday at 5.30pm \/ Saturday at 2.30pm \r\n\r\nPachecolaan 34, 1000 Brussels, 1st floor","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540681"},"de":{"name":"PREFIGURATIONS: een tentoonstelling over Architectuur en Transities","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540681"},"it":{"name":"PREFIGURATIONS: een tentoonstelling over Architectuur en Transities","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540681"},"sp":{"name":"PREFIGURATIONS: een tentoonstelling over Architectuur en Transities","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540681"},"pt":{"name":"PREFIGURATIONS: een tentoonstelling over Architectuur en Transities","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540681"},"cn":{"name":"PREFIGURATIONS: een tentoonstelling over Architectuur en Transities","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":nul