ing":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539840"}},"place":{"id":265522,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.conservatoire.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 30","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Conservatoire royal de Bruxelles organise pr\u00e8s de 200 \u00e9v\u00e9nements (hors \u00e9valuations publiques) chaque saison, offrant ainsi aux \u00e9tudiants le temps de l\u2019\u00e9change avec le public. Concerts symphoniques dans la grande salle du Conservatoire, ou rencontres plus intimes \u00e0 l\u2019Auditorium Joseph Jongen et dans les lieux partenaires du Conservatoire, de nombreuses occasions leurs permettent d'appr\u00e9hender la sc\u00e8ne, encadr\u00e9s par leurs enseignants ou en \u00e9lectrons libres lors des Nocturnes ou du festival Courants d\u2019airs.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Koninklijk Conservatorium van Brussel","address_street_name":"Regentschapsstraat","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.conservatoire.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Regentschapsstraat, 30","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De meeste concerten georganiseerd door het KCB zijn gratis toegankelijk, voor sommige echter wordt een inkomprijs gevraagd om de professionele omkadering van de verschillende projecten voor de studenten te financieren. Bijzondere concerten zijn ondermeer het Nieuwjaarsconcert met feestelijke ontvangst, musicalvoorstellingen als eigen productie van het KCB, concerten in samenwerking met de Koninklijke Muziekkapel van De Gidsen en  benefietconcerten. De reservatie voor alle betalende concerten is mogelijk via BOZAR.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Concervatory of Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.conservatoire.be\/en\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 30","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Concert Society (Concertvereniging) vzw was born in the lap of the Brussels Royal Conservatory. Each year the Society programmes a series of concerts in which the students at the Conservatory get the chance to gain experience of performing on stage. Teachers and students work together intensively to prepare for these concerts, an experience which undoubtedly makes a positive contribution to the students' education.\r\nMany initiatives take place in co-production with other institutions and musical societies such as the Royal College of Music in London, the Conservatoire national sup\u00e9rieur de musique of Paris, the Musikhochschulen of Vienna, Graz and Cologne, the Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles, the Koninklijke Conservatoria in Rotterdam and in Den Haag, the Lemmensinstituut in Louvain, the Filharmonische Vereniging van Brussel, Europalia, and the arts festivals \"Ars Musica\" and \"De barokke Lente van de Zavel\".\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.conservatoire.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 30","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":""