"nl":{"name":"O.L.V. Ten Zavel","address_street_name":"Zavelstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zavelstraat","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Deze kerk is een waardevol voorbeeld van de bloei van de Brabantse laatgotische kunst. Ze dankt haar schoonheid aan de Grote Gilde van Kruisboogschutters van de stad, die haar in de 15e eeuw bouwden. Verscheidene leden van de familie Thurn und Taxis kwamen samen in de sarcofagen onder de barokke Heilige Ursulakapel, daar waar nu hun begraafplaats is. Als u in de omgeving van deze kerk komt, aarzel dan niet om er binnen te gaan om de architectuur en de vele glas-in-loodramen te bezichtingen. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"\u00c9glise Notre-Dame des Victoires du Sablon","address_street_name":"Rue des Sablons","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue des Sablons","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"This church is a precious example of the development of ogival art from Brabant.\r\nIt owes its beauty to the city\u2019s crossbowmen, who built it in the 15th century.\r\nSeveral member of the Thurn und Taxis family are buried there in sarcophagi placed under the chapel of Saint Ursula, which is their burial site. If you pass by this church, do not hesitate to enter and contemplate its architecture and numerous stained glass windows.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Kirche Notre-Dame des Victoires du Sablon","address_street_name":"Rue des Sablons","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sablons","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Kirche ist ein pr\u00e4chtiges Beispiel f\u00fcr die Entwicklung der Brabanter Spitzbogenarchitektur. Ihre Sch\u00f6nheit verdankt sie den Armbrustsch\u00fctzen der Stadt, die sie im 15. Jahrhundert erbauten. Vertreter der Familie Thurn und Taxis fanden ihre letzte Ruhe in den Sarkophagen unter der Sankt-Ursula-Kapelle. Sowohl die Architektur als auch die bunten Kirchenfenster sind absolut sehenswert. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"\u00c9glise Notre-Dame des Victoires du Sablon","address_street_name":"Rue des Sablons","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sablons","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"\u00c9glise Notre-Dame des Victoires du Sablon","address_street_name":"Rue des Sablons","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sablons","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Esta iglesia es un ejemplo precioso del desarrollo del arte ojival de Brabante.\r\nDebe su belleza a los ballesteros de la ciudad que la reedificaron en el siglo XV.\r\nVarios miembros de la familia de Thurn y Taxis se encuentran en los sarc\u00f3fagos de la capilla de Santa \u00darsula, que es actualmente su lugar de sepultura.\r\nSi visitas esta iglesia, no dudes en entrar y contemplar su arquitectura y sus numerosas vitrinas.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Igreja de Nossa Senhora das Vit\u00f3rias de Sablon","address_street_name":"Rue des Sablons","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sablons","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Esta igreja \u00e9 um exemplo perfeito do florescimento da arte ogival de Brabante. Deve a sua beleza aos carpinteiros da cidade, que a constru\u00edram no s\u00e9culo XV. V\u00e1rios membros da fam\u00edlia de Tour e Tassis est\u00e3o a\u00ed reunidos nos sarc\u00f3fagos por baixo da capela Sainte-Ursule, que se tornou o seu lugar de sepultura. Se passar pr\u00f3ximo desta igreja, n\u00e3o hesite em entrar, para contemplar a sua arquitetura e os seus v\u00e1rios vitrais.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"\u00c9glise Notre-Dame des Victoires du Sablon","address_street_name":"Rue des Sablons","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sablons","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":458,"location":{"lat":50.83998854,"lon":4.35581725},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-09-12T09:05:16+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:33+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":274604,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Rotary Club Bruxelles Renaissance","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"890","address_street_box":"1000","email":"secretary@rotaryrenaissance.eu","website":"htt