ende personen","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen"],"en":["Accessible","Facilities for blind and partially-sighted persons","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-08-12T15:05:06+02:00","published_at":"2022-08-12T14:38:05+02:00","backoffice_id":259632,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"party","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":539361,"date_start":"2022-09-16","date_end":"2022-09-18","date_next":"2022-09-16","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":true,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"nl":["Theater"],"en":["Theatre"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"L'affaire Frank Smith","shortdescr":"Com\u00e9die contemporaine de Patrick Chaboud cr\u00e9\u00e9e sous le titre \"La fin du mois commence le 2\" et r\u00e9\u00e9crite par Claire-Marie Lievens pour l'amener au d\u00e9but du XX\u00e8me si\u00e8cle, \"L'affaire Frank Smith\" est un \"d\u00eener de con\" sauce 1930. Rire, myst\u00e8re et quiproquo se rencontrent pour le plus grand plaisir des spectatrices et spectateurs !","longdescr":"Nous sommes en 1925, dans un appartement cossu du centre de Bruxelles. On y retrouve Paul, l'\u00e9l\u00e8ve, et Michel, le professeur de savoir-vivre. Ce soir-l\u00e0, Paul re\u00e7oit Carole, la dame de son c\u0153ur. Mais pour ne pas lui imposer un d\u00eener en t\u00eate-\u00e0-t\u00eate, d'autres invit\u00e9s sont de la partie,tout cela s'annonce festif ! Mais l'un boit trop, l'autre fait des crises d'angoisse et manque de s'\u00e9touffer, et surtout, Carole n'arrive pas... Rien ne se passe comme pr\u00e9vu, les \u00e9v\u00e9nements s'encha\u00eenent \u00e0 un rythme effr\u00e9n\u00e9 et les langues se d\u00e9lient dans un joyeux bazar.","performers":"Ecriture : Patrick ChaboudR\u00e9\u00e9criture : Claire-Marie LievensMise en sc\u00e8ne : Claire-Marie LievensAssistanat : Polona GolobDistribution (par ordre d'apparition)Michel : William Coomans de Brach\u00e8nePaul : S\u00e9bastien CulotRaymond : Mathias LenaAnnie : Anne-Lia Al MeyerGwendoline : Victoria von HammersteinCarole : Gisela Castro","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=MAGICLAND&s=EFE71E86-9DB8-3F0D-859E-B0E003F6CB3E","email":"fratriha@fratriha.com","phone_contact":"+32 498 48 32 48","phone_booking":"+32 2 245 50 64","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539361"},"nl":{"name":"L'affaire Frank Smith","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539361"},"en":{"name":"L'affaire Frank Smith","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539361"},"de":{"name":"L'affaire Frank Smith","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539361"},"it":{"name":"L'affaire Frank Smith","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539361"},"sp":{"name":"L'affaire Frank Smith","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539361"},"pt":{"name":"L'affaire Frank Smith","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539361"},"cn":{"name":"L'affaire Frank Smith","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539361"}},"place":{"id":224842,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Magic Land Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","address_street_name":"Rue d'Hoogvorst","address_street_number":"8-14","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@magicland-theatre.com","website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 50 64","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue d'Hoogvorst, 8-14","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Magic Land Theatre","address_street_name":"d'Hoogvorststraat","address_street_number":"8-14","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@magicland-theatre.com","website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 50 64","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaarbeek","address_line1":"d'Hoogvorststraat, 8-14","address_line2":"1030 Schaarbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Magic Land Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","address_street_name":"Rue d'Hoogvorst","address_street_number":"8-14","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@magicland-theatre.com","website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 50 64","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue d'Hoogvorst, 8-14","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"The Magic Land Th\u00e9\u00e2tre was born out of a collective dream in the 1970s. It now has its\r\nactive, around fifty creations, several international tours and participation regular at most major Belgian cultural events. His multiple exp\u00e9riences artistic works carried out on so many fronts have allowed him to forge a style so particular, far removed off the beaten track of classical theater. If we had to classify the \"Magic land\" in a category \" popular theater \"is undoubtedly the adjective which would suit best even if Patrick Chaboud its founder prefers to speak of a theater of exchanges, meetings, surprises, debates, emotions and forcing anger sometimes too. At the Magic land theater, the scenic barriers conventional have long since been abolished in order to build bridges between genders, heater, dance, music, circus, humor. The Magic Land Theater is ultimately, above all, a living theater, a theater in perpetual \"reinvention\" to better ward off ideas black.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Magic Land Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","address_street_name":"Rue d'Hoogvorst","address_street_number":"8-14","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@magicland-theatre.com","website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 50 64","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue d'Hoogvorst, 8-14","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Magic Land Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","address_street_name":"Rue d'Hoogvorst","address_street_number":"8-14","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@magicland-theatre.com","website":"http:\/\/www.magic