en":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[476651],"targets":{"list":[7,8,11,10],"translations":{"fr":["Jeunes 12-15 ans","Jeunes 15-18 ans","Famille","Seniors"],"nl":["Jongeren 12-15 j.","Jongeren 15-18 j.","Familie","Senioren"],"en":["Youth 12-15  yr.","Youth 15-18  yr.","Family","Seniors"]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,259,265,266],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Chien d'assistance","WC adapt\u00e9","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Assistentiehonden","Aangepast toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Accessible","Assistance dogs","Adapted toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-08-09T04:35:07+02:00","published_at":"2022-06-13T17:34:24+02:00","backoffice_id":255883,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.34430603773932},{"id":538544,"date_start":"2022-09-16","date_end":"2022-11-05","date_next":"2022-09-16","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[36,44],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Design"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Design"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Design"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Graduation Show","shortdescr":"Rencontrez la future g\u00e9n\u00e9ration de la mode et du design bruxellois!","longdescr":"Le MAD Brussels d\u00e9cerne chaque ann\u00e9e 10 prix, d'une valeur de 1 000 euros chacun, aux dipl\u00f4m\u00e9.es des \u00e9coles cr\u00e9atives Bruxelloises. Cette ann\u00e9e pour la premi\u00e8re fois, les dix \u00e9tudiant.es s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9.es pr\u00e9sentent leurs travaux de fin d'\u00e9tude lors d'une exposition au MAD. Ainsi nous mettons en lumi\u00e8re non seulement les nouveaux talents cr\u00e9atif.ves mais nous pr\u00e9sentons aussi le large \u00e9vantails de formations cr\u00e9atives que la ville de Bruxelles a \u00e0 offrir. De la mode au design d'int\u00e9rieur, en passant par le textile, la recherche et le design industriel.\r\n\r\nUne exposition avec\r\n\r\nLouise Richard \u2014 Design textile \u00e0 ARBA-ESA\r\nFlorent Seligmann \u2014 Fashion design \u00e0 La Cambre\r\nMaxime Trassebot \u2014 Design industriel \u00e0 La Cambre\r\nHelen Van de Vloet \u2014 Design textile \u00e0 La Cambre\r\nRosamilia Lea \u2014 Fashion Design and Model Making \u00e0 la Haute Ecole Francisco Ferrer [HEFF]\r\nM\u00e9lanie Chillaud \u2014 Arts du Tissus \u00e0 la Haute Ecole Francisco Ferrer [HEFF]\r\nManon Verniers \u2014 Design d'int\u00e9rieur \u00e0 LUCA School of Arts\r\nSteven Da Cruz Gon\u00e7alves \u2014 Design d'int\u00e9rieur \u00e0 Ateliers Saint-Luc\r\nEmilien Maree \u2014 Architecture et design d'interieur au College of Art and Design Brussels [CAD]","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538544"},"nl":{"name":"Graduation Show","shortdescr":"Ontmoet de toekomstige mode- en design generatie!","longdescr":"MAD Brussels reikt jaarlijks 10 prijzen uit, elk ter waarde van 1.000 euro, aan afgestudeerden van de Brusselse creatieve scholen. Voor het eerst stellen deze tien geselecteerde studenten ook hun eindwerken voor tijdens de Graduation Show 2022. Zo wordt niet enkel nieuw talent in de kijker gezet, maar wordt ook de waaier aan opleidingen getoond die de stad Brussel te bieden heeft. Van mode en interieurdesign tot textiel, research en industrieel productdesign.\r\n\r\nEen tentoonstelling door\r\n\r\nLouise Richard \u2014 Textiel design aan ARBA-ESA\r\nFlorent Seligmann \u2014 Mode-ontwerp aan La Cambre\r\nMaxime Trassebot \u2014 Industrieel ontwerp aan La Cambre\r\nHelen Van de Vloet \u2014 Textiel ontwerp aan La Cambre\r\nRosamilia Lea \u2014 Mode-ontwerp aan Haute Ecole Francisco Ferrer [HEFF]\r\nM\u00e9lanie Chillaud \u2014 Textiel ontwerp aan Haute Ecole Francisco Ferrer [HEFF]\r\nManon Verniers \u2014 Interieurontwerp aan LUCA School of Arts\r\nSteven Da Cruz Gon\u00e7alves \u2014 Interieurontwerp aan Ateliers Saint-Luc\r\nEmilien Maree \u2014 Interieurarchitectuur aan College of Art and Design Brussels [CAD]","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/graduation-show-2022","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538544"},"en":{"name":"Graduation Show","shortdescr":"Meet the future Brussels fashion and design generation!","longdescr":"MAD Brussels annually awards 10 prizes, each worth 1,000 euros, to graduates of the Brussels creative schools. For the first time, these ten selected students also present their final works during an exhibition at MAD. It not only puts the various new talents in the spotlight, but also shows the range of courses that the city of Brussels has to offer. From fashion and interior design to textiles, research and industrial product design.\r\n\r\nAn exhibition with\r\n\r\nLouise Richard \u2014 Textile design at ARBA-ESA\r\nFlorent Seligmann \u2014 Fashion design at La Cambre\r\nMaxime Trassebot \u2014 Industrial Design at La Cambre\r\nHelen Van de Vloet \u2014 Textile Design at La Cambre\r\nRosamilia Lea \u2014 Fashion Design and Model Making at Haute Ecole Francisco Ferrer [HEFF]\r\nM\u00e9lanie Chillaud \u2014 Fabric Arts at Haute Ecole Francisco Ferrer [HEFF]\r\nManon Verniers \u2014 Interior Design at LUCA School of Arts\r\nSteven Da Cruz Gon\u00e7alves \u2014 Interior Design at Ateliers Saint-Luc\r\nEmilien Maree \u2014 Interior Architecture and Design at College of Art and Design Brussels [CAD]","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538544"},"de":{"name":"Graduation Show","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538544"},"it":{"name":"Graduation Show","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538544"},"sp":{"name":"Graduation Show","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538544"},"pt":{"name":"Graduation Show","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538544"},"cn":{"name":"Graduation Show","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538544"}},"place":{"id":250516,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels est la plateforme bruxelloise d\u2019expertise dans les secteurs de la Mode et du Design.   Elle s\u2019emploie \u00e0 renforcer la promotion, \u00e0 accompagner le d\u00e9veloppement des stylistes et designers bruxellois et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre leur rayonnement (inter )national.  \r\n\r\nL\u2019ouverture en avril 2017 du nouveau b\u00e2timent enti\u00e8rement blanc a marqu\u00e9 une renaissance pour l\u2019asbl, qui dans ce lieu unique multiplie et combine ses actions. Il h\u00e9berge le centre de ressources pour les professionnels des industries cr\u00e9atives aux fili\u00e8res de m\u00e9tiers d\u00e9riv\u00e9es, des espaces de travail polyvalents, lieux de rencontres, d\u2019accueil de cr\u00e9ateurs, d\u2019ateliers, de s\u00e9minaires, ainsi qu\u2019un grand espace d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux activit\u00e9s publiques o\u00f9 sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e de multiples \u00e9v\u00e8nements: expositions, d\u00e9fil\u00e9s, performances artistiques,\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"MAD Brussels is het Brussels kennisplatform voor de mode- en designsectoren.  Het zet zich in voor de promotie en begeleiding van Brusselse stylisten en ontwerpers en de vergroting van hun (inter)nationale uitstraling. \r\n\r\nDe opening van hun nieuwe, volledig witte gebouw in april 2017 betekende een belangrijke impuls voor de vzw die op die unieke plek zijn verschillende doelstellingen kan uitbreiden en combineren. Het gebouw herbergt het onderzoekscentrum voor professionals uit de creatieve sectoren en aanverwante beroepsgroepen, multifunctionele werkruimtes, ontmoetingsplekken, ontvangstruimtes voor ontwerpers, workshops en seminaries en daarbij ook nog een grote ruimte waarin elk jaar verschillende activiteiten voor het grote publiek plaatsvinden, zoals tentoonstellingen, modeshows of artistieke performances.  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"MAD Brussels is a Brussels\u2019 platform for gathering expertise from the city\u2019s Fashion and Design sectors. It aims to help with the promotion and development of Brussels stylists and designers and improve their exposure nationally and abroad.\r\n\r\nThe opening in April 2017 of their brand new, sparkling white headquarters marked something of a renaissance for the non-profit organisation, which can now multiply and combine its campaigns. It houses a ressource centre for professionals of the creative industries and related sectors, along with adaptable workspaces, meeting spaces, workshops, seminar rooms and a large space dedicated to public activities where multiple events are organised every year: exhibitions, fashion shows, artistic performances\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels ist eine Br\u00fcsseler Mode- und Designplattform, die sich der F\u00f6rderung, Unterst\u00fctzung und Begleitung der Br\u00fcsseler Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designern verschrieben hat, um sowohl landesweit als auch international ihre Reichweite zu erh\u00f6hen.\r\n\r\nDie Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen, komplett in Wei\u00df gehaltenen Geb\u00e4udes hat dem MAD Brussels noch einmal frischen Wind in den Segeln beschert. Hier befinden sich nicht nur Ressourcen f\u00fcr Vertreter der Kreativindustrie und damit zusammenh\u00e4ngenden Metiers, sondern auch vielf\u00e4ltig nutzbare Arbeitspl\u00e4tze und Orte der Begegnung. Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designer haben hier eine Anlaufstelle, gleichzeitig finden in den R\u00e4umen Ateliers, Workshops, Seminare, Ausstellungen, Modeschauen, Kunst-Performances statt\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels es una plataforma de Bruselas que reune expertos del los sectores de la moda y el dise\u00f1o. Tiene como objetivo ayudar en la promoci\u00f3n y el desarrollo de los dise\u00f1adores y estilistas de Bruselas y mejorar su imagen nacional e internacional.\r\nLa apertura de su novedosa y chispeante sede en abril de 2017 marc\u00f3 algo as\u00ed como el renacimiento para la organizaci\u00f3n sin \u00e1nimo de lucro, que ahora puede multiplicar y combinar sus campa\u00f1as. Posee un centro de recursos para profesionales de industrias culturales y sectores relacionados, junto con espacios de trabajo adaptados, lugares de reuni\u00f3n, talleres, seminarios y un gran espacio dedicado a actividades p\u00fablicas donde se organizan diversos eventos cada a\u00f1o: exhibiciones, desfiles de moda, representaciones art\u00edsticas\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":12629,"location":{"lat":50.85116098,"lon":4.34417688},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-08-10T17:36:20+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:34:31+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":250516,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels est la plateforme bruxelloise d\u2019expertise dans les secteurs de la Mode et du Design.   Elle s\u2019emploie \u00e0 renforcer la promotion, \u00e0 accompagner le d\u00e9veloppement des stylistes et designers bruxellois et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre leur rayonnement (inter )national.  \r\n\r\nL\u2019ouverture en avril 2017 du nouveau b\u00e2timent enti\u00e8rement blanc a marqu\u00e9 une renaissance pour l\u2019asbl, qui dans ce lieu unique multiplie et combine ses actions. Il h\u00e9berge le centre de ressources pour les professionnels des industries cr\u00e9atives aux fili\u00e8res de m\u00e9tiers d\u00e9riv\u00e9es, des espaces de travail polyvalents, lieux de rencontres, d\u2019accueil de cr\u00e9ateurs, d\u2019ateliers, de s\u00e9minaires, ainsi qu\u2019un grand espace d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux activit\u00e9s publiques o\u00f9 sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e de multiples \u00e9v\u00e8nements: expositions, d\u00e9fil\u00e9s, performances artistiques,\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"MAD Brussels is het Brussels kennisplatform voor de mode- en designsectoren.  Het zet zich in voor de promotie en begeleiding van Brusselse stylisten en ontwerpers en de vergroting van hun (inter)nationale uitstraling. \r\n\r\nDe opening van hun nieuwe, volledig witte gebouw in april 2017 betekende een belangrijke impuls voor de vzw die op die unieke plek zijn verschillende doelstellingen kan uitbreiden en combineren. Het gebouw herbergt het onderzoekscentrum voor professionals uit de creatieve sectoren en aanverwante beroepsgroepen, multifunctionele werkruimtes, ontmoetingsplekken, ontvangstruimtes voor ontwerpers, workshops en seminaries en daarbij ook nog een grote ruimte waarin elk jaar verschillende activiteiten voor het grote publiek plaatsvinden, zoals tentoonstellingen, modeshows of artistieke performances.  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"MAD Brussels is a Brussels\u2019 platform for gathering expertise from the city\u2019s Fashion and Design sectors. It aims to help with the promotion and development of Brussels stylists and designers and improve their exposure nationally and abroad.\r\n\r\nThe opening in April 2017 of their brand new, sparkling white headquarters marked something of a renaissance for the non-profit organisation, which can now multiply and combine its campaigns. It houses a ressource centre for professionals of the creative industries and related sectors, along with adaptable workspaces, meeting spaces, workshops, seminar rooms and a large space dedicated to public activities where multiple events are organised every year: exhibitions, fashion shows, artistic performances\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels ist eine Br\u00fcsseler Mode- und Designplattform, die sich der F\u00f6rderung, Unterst\u00fctzung und Begleitung der Br\u00fcsseler Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designern verschrieben hat, um sowohl landesweit als auch international ihre Reichweite zu erh\u00f6hen.\r\n\r\nDie Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen, komplett in Wei\u00df gehaltenen Geb\u00e4udes hat dem MAD Brussels noch einmal frischen Wind in den Segeln beschert. Hier befinden sich nicht nur Ressourcen f\u00fcr Vertreter der Kreativindustrie und damit zusammenh\u00e4ngenden Metiers, sondern auch vielf\u00e4ltig nutzbare Arbeitspl\u00e4tze und Orte der Begegnung. Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designer haben hier eine Anlaufstelle, gleichzeitig finden in den R\u00e4umen Ateliers, Workshops, Seminare, Ausstellungen, Modeschauen, Kunst-Performances statt\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels es una plataforma de Bruselas que reune expertos del los sectores de la moda y el dise\u00f1o. Tiene como objetivo ayudar en la promoci\u00f3n y el desarrollo de los dise\u00f1adores y estilistas de Bruselas y mejorar su imagen nacional e internacional.\r\nLa apertura de su novedosa y chispeante sede en abril de 2017 marc\u00f3 algo as\u00ed como el renacimiento para la organizaci\u00f3n sin \u00e1nimo de lucro, que ahora puede multiplicar y combinar sus campa\u00f1as. Posee un centro de recursos para profesionales de industrias culturales y sectores relacionados, junto con espacios de trabajo adaptados, lugares de reuni\u00f3n, talleres, seminarios y un gran espacio dedicado a actividades p\u00fablicas donde se organizan diversos eventos cada a\u00f1o: exhibiciones, desfiles de moda, representaciones art\u00edsticas\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":12629,"location":{"lat":50.85116098,"lon":4.34417688},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-08-10T17:36:20+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:34:31+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/fa8c5bda7cda0d3a829c0434df5d7507f20f49db.jpg","width":3750,"height":2500,"ratio":1.5,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Graduation Show","copyright":"Maxime Trassebot \u2014 Photography by Th\u00e9o Desm