ed and we'll do our utmost best to burn the place down\" \u2013 whether we should take that as a threat or not is still to be decided. We'll see you down the front to see what the fuss is about!\r\n\r\n\u2022 https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/Ordigort\r\n\u2022 https:\/\/ordigort-iec.bandcamp.com\r\n\r\nASHTORETH (BE - Consouling Sounds) Drone Ambient\/Doom\r\nAshtoreth is a project in a search of a shamanistic perspective, channeling at times minimal, meditative drones; and at others a catharsis of doom, noise and experimentation touching upon folk, post-rock, psychedelica and more. Always in a free form.\r\n\r\n\u2022 https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/people\/ASHTORETH\/100063497169807\r\n\u2022 https:\/\/ashtoreth1.bandcamp.com","performers":"Alkerdeel; Sum of R; Ordigort; Ashtoreth","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538160"},"de":{"name":"Consouling Sounds evening: Alkerdeel + Sum of R (CH\/FI) + Ordigort + Ashtoreth","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538160"},"it":{"name":"Consouling Sounds evening: Alkerdeel + Sum of R (CH\/FI) + Ordigort + Ashtoreth","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538160"},"sp":{"name":"Consouling Sounds evening: Alkerdeel + Sum of R (CH\/FI) + Ordigort + Ashtoreth","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538160"},"pt":{"name":"Consouling Sounds evening: Alkerdeel + Sum of R (CH\/FI)