Toegankelijk","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen"],"en":["Accessible","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-09-09T15:05:13+02:00","published_at":"2022-09-09T14:42:06+02:00","backoffice_id":261441,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"concert","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":540092,"date_start":"2022-09-17","date_end":"2022-09-17","date_next":"2022-09-17","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":84,"translations":{"fr":"Divers","nl":"Varia","en":"Various"}},"others":{"list":[87],"translations":{"fr":["Kermesses et festivit\u00e9s"],"nl":["Kermissen en feestelijkhheden"],"en":["Charity fairs and festivities"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"La F\u00eate de la Propret\u00e9 d'Etterbeek","shortdescr":"Comme chaque ann\u00e9e, la F\u00eate de la Propret\u00e9 d'Etterbeek et son grand nettoyage de rue participatif revient \u00e0 l'occasion du World Cleanup Day.","longdescr":"Depuis plusieurs ann\u00e9es, la F\u00eate de la Propret\u00e9 est organis\u00e9e dans le cadre du \u00ab World Cleanup Day \u00bb, une initiative soutenue par le Programme des Nations Unies et organis\u00e9e dans pas moins de 150 pays.\r\n\r\nAu programme : des stands d\u2019information et de sensibilisation, des \u00e9changes avec nos agents de la voirie et la possibilit\u00e9 de vous familiariser avec le charroi communal de la propret\u00e9 (balayeuse, v\u00e9lo cargo anti tag et camion compacteur).\r\n\r\nEt comme chaque ann\u00e9e, vous aurez l\u2019occasion de participer \u00e0 un grand clean up festif entre 14h et 16h. Cette ann\u00e9e, les \u00ab cleaners \u00bb se d\u00e9ploieront, au choix et librement, depuis la place Jourdan, la place du Roi Vainqueur ou l'esplanade de l'h\u00f4tel communal (av. des Casernes 31). Depuis cette derni\u00e8re, un clean up collectif et en musique d\u00e9marrera \u00e0 14h !\r\n\r\nNous vous conseillons vivement de vous munir de gants r\u00e9utilisables afin d\u2019\u00e9viter les gants en latex jetables. Les organisateurs fourniront l\u2019\u00e9quipement indispensable \u00e0 la chasse aux d\u00e9chets : sacs poubelle, gants en latex, pinces et contenants pour r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer les m\u00e9gots (qui seront ensuite valoris\u00e9s).\r\n\r\nRetour ensuite au point de ralliement sur l\u2019esplanade de l\u2019h\u00f4tel communal \u00e0 16h pour une s\u00e9rie de concerts et d\u2019animations sans oublier le verre de l\u2019amiti\u00e9 !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.etterbeek.brussels","email":"proprete.prevention@etterbeek.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 80 02 57 55","phone_booking":"+32 80 02 57 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540092"},"nl":{"name":"Het Netheidsfeest van Etterbeek","shortdescr":"Zoals elk jaar organiseren we het Netheidsfeest en een grote participatieve stratenschoonmaak ter gelegenheid van World Cleanup Day.","longdescr":"Het Netheidsfeest wordt al enkele jaren georganiseerd in het kader van \u201cWorld Cleanup Day\u201d, een initiatief dat de steun krijgt van de Verenigde Naties en dat in 150 landen wordt georganiseerd.\r\n\r\nOp het programma: info- en bewustmakingsstands, ontmoeting met onze wegenismedewerkers en kennismaking met het gemeentelijke wagenpark van de dienst Netheid (veegmachine, transportfiets van de anti-tagdienst, vuilniswagen).\r\n\r\nZoals elk jaar kan je deelnemen aan een feestelijke clean up tussen 14 en 16 uur. Dit jaar gaan de \u201ccleaners\u201d aan de slag vanaf het Jourdanplein, Koning Overwinnaarplein en de esplanade van het gemeentehuis (Kazernenlaan 31). Aan het gemeentehuis vertrekt een gezamenlijke clean up met muzikale begeleiding om 14 uur!\r\n\r\nWij raden je aan om herbruikbare handschoenen mee te brengen om wegwerpbare latexhandschoenen te vermijden. De organisatoren voorzien het nodige materiaal voor de schoonmaakacties: vuilniszakken, handschoenen, tangen en verpakkingen om sigarettenpeuken te verzamelen (die nadien worden gevaloriseerd).\r\n\r\nVervolgens terugkeer naar het verzamelpunt op de esplanade van het gemeentehuis om 16 uur voor enkele concerten, animatieactiviteiten en een drankje natuurlijk!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"proprete.prevention@etterbeek.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540092"},"en":{"name":"The Etterbeek\u2019s Cleanliness  Feast","shortdescr":"Like every year, the celebration of cleanliness and its big participatory street cleaning is coming back on the occasion of the World Cleanup Day.","longdescr":"\u2022For several years, the cleanliness festival has been organized as part of the \u00ab World Cleanup Day \u00bb, an initiative supported by the United Nations and organized in no  less than 150 countries.\r\n\r\nOn the program : information and awareness stands, discussions with our road workers and the possibility of familiarizing yourself with the municipal cleanliness cartage (sweeper, anti-tag cargo bike and compactor truck).\r\n\r\nAnd like every year, you will have the opportunity to take part in a great festive clean up between 2 and 4 p.m. This year, the cleaners will deploy, as they wish and freely, from Place Jourdan, Place du Roi Vainqueur or the Esplanade of the municipal Town Hall (av. des Casernes 31). Since this year, a collective clean up with music will start at 2 p.m!\r\n\r\nWe strongly advise you to bring reusable gloves to avoid disposable latex gloves. The organizers will provide the equipment needed for the waste hunt : garbage bags, latex gloves, tongs and containers to collect the cigarette butts (which will then be valued).\r\n\r\nThen return to the checkpoint on the esplanade of the Town Hall at 4 p.m. for a series of concerts and entertainment, without forgetting the glass of friendship !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"proprete.prevention@etterbeek.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540092"},"de":{"name":"La F\u00eate de la Propret\u00e9 d'Etterbeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540092"},"it":{"name":"La F\u00eate de la Propret\u00e9 d'Etterbeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540092"},"sp":{"name":"La F\u00eate de la Propret\u00e9 d'Etterbeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540092"},"pt":{"name":"La F\u00eate de la Propret\u00e9 d'Etterbeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540092"},"cn":{"name":"La F\u00eate de la Propret\u00e9 d'Etterbeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540092"}},"place":{"id":267709,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Administration communale d'Etterbeek","