e month from 16:00 to 17:30"}}],"closing_days":["2022-10-01"],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":20}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"visit_profile":{"list":[323],"translations":{"fr":["Gastronomie"],"nl":["Gastronomie"],"en":["Gastronomy"]}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-09-11T01:08:58+02:00","published_at":"2022-09-01T17:07:51+02:00","backoffice_id":260832,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.21129929348218},{"id":541298,"date_start":"2022-09-17","date_end":"2022-12-31","date_next":"2022-09-17","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[36,48],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Architecture"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Architectuur"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Architecture "]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","shortdescr":"Apr\u00e8s plusieurs mois de fermeture, le b\u00e9guinage entrouvre ses portes au public pour certaines dates en 2022. Cette ouverture exceptionnelle offre la possibilit\u00e9 de d\u00e9couvrir ce bijou architectural enti\u00e8rement restaur\u00e9 et encore totalement \u00e0 nu.","longdescr":"Le b\u00e9guinage d\u2019Anderlecht est le plus petit b\u00e9guinage de Belgique. Fond\u00e9 en 1252, il se compose actuellement de deux ailes encadrant un jardin clos, dot\u00e9 d\u2019un puits. Il accueillait des b\u00e9guines jusqu\u2019\u00e0 la R\u00e9volution fran\u00e7aise; il servit ensuite d\u2019hospice et de logement pour femmes indigentes, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 sa fermeture en 1928.\r\n\r\nLe b\u00e9guinage a subi une restauration approfondie et est d\u00e9sormais ouvert aux visiteurs. Un nouveau projet mus\u00e9al est en cours d\u2019\u00e9laboration et sera finalis\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019automne 2023.\r\n\r\nJours d'ouverture 2022 :\r\n- 17>18\/09 r\u00e9ouverture lors des Heritage days\r\nPlace \u00e0 l\u2019art et \u00e0 la musique avec un programme sp\u00e9cial en lien avec l\u2019histoire du lieu. Les cr\u00e9ations r\u00e9sonneront avec cette architecture qui a travers\u00e9 les si\u00e8cles. \r\nVisites guid\u00e9es, concert, perfomances, installation vid\u00e9o et drink.\r\n- Chaque 1er dimanche du mois (02\/10, 06\/11, 04\/12)\r\n+ visite guid\u00e9e \u00e0 14h\r\n- Archiweeks 22 & 23\/10\r\nvisites guid\u00e9es\r\n- R\u00e9servez une visite guid\u00e9e \u00e0 un autre moment (contactez-nous)","performers":"Partenaires de la restauration du b\u00e9guinage :\r\n\u2013 La commune d\u2019Anderlecht (Ma\u00eetre d\u2019ouvrage)\r\n\u2013 Urban.brussels (autorit\u00e9 subsidiante et accompagnement technique)\r\n\u2013 Les mus\u00e9es communaux Maison d\u2019\u00c9rasme & B\u00e9guinage\r\n\u2013 Arter (bureau d\u2019\u00e9tude)\r\n\u2013 Arthur Vandendorpe (entrepreneur)\r\n\u2013 Le CReA-Patrimoine (ULB), l\u2019ULg\r\n\u2013 L\u2019IRPA","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum\/2022\/08\/1718-09-reouverture-beguinage-heritage-days\/","email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541298"},"nl":{"name":"Heropening van het begijnhof van Anderlecht","shortdescr":"Het Begijnhof van Anderlecht opent alvast eventjes in 2022, na een paar maanden te zijn gesloten, zijn deuren voor het publiek. Deze speciale openingsdagen bieden de mogelijkheid dit volledig gerestaureerde architecturale juweeltje, nog helemaal kaal, te ontdekken.","longdescr":"Het Begijnhof van Anderlecht is het kleinste begijnhof van Belgi\u00eb. Gesticht in 1252 bestaat het tegenwoordig uit twee vleugels rondom een ommuurde tuin met waterput. Hier vonden de begijnen onderdak tot aan de Franse Revolutie, waarna het diende als hospies en verblijf voor armlastige vrouwen tot het in 1928 zijn deuren sloot. Na een grondige restauratie staat het Begijnhof voortaan weer open voor bezoekers!\r\n\r\nMomenteel wordt een nieuw museologisch project uitgewerkt dat tegen de herfst 2023 voltooid zou moeten zijn.\r\n\r\nOpeningsdagen 2022:\r\n\u2013 17 & 18\/09\/2022: Heritage days\r\nconcert, performance, drink, video-installatie, rondleiding\r\n\u2013 Iedere 1ste zondag van de maand (2\/10, 6\/11 en 4\/12)\r\nOpeningstijden: 10.00 uur -18.00 uur\r\nRondleidingen \u00ab Architectuur & Geschiedenis \u00bb: 14.00 uur\r\n\u2013 22 & 23\/10 (Archiweek)\r\nRondleidingen\r\n\u2013 Boek een rondleiding op een andere datum (contact ons)","performers":"Partners van de restauratie van het Begijnhof:\r\n\u2013 De gemeente Anderlecht (opdrachtgever)\r\n\u2013 Urban.brussels (subsidi\u00ebrend orgaan en technische begeleiding)\r\n\u2013 De gemeentelijke musea Erasmus & Begijnhof\r\n\u2013 Arter (studiebureau)\r\n\u2013 Arthur Vandendorpe (ondernemer)\r\n\u2013 CReA-Patrimoine (ULB), ULg\r\n\u2013 KIK","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum\/nl\/2022\/08\/1718-09-heropening-van-het-begijnhof-van-anderlecht-heritage-days\/","email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541298"},"en":{"name":"Re-opening of the Anderlecht beguinage","shortdescr":"After several months\u2019 closure, the Anderlecht beguinage is opening its doors to the public for a few events in 2022. These exceptional opening days will enable everyone to discover this entirely restored architectural jewel in a pristine state.","longdescr":"The Beguinage of Anderlecht is the smallest beguinage in Belgium. It was founded in 1252 and today consists of two wings framing an enclosed garden with its own well. It took in beguines (women in a secular religious community) until the French Revolution and then served as a hospice and housing for indigent women until it closed in 1928.\r\n\r\nThe beguinage has been restored in depth and is once again open to visitors! A new museum project is currently in the pipeline and will be finalised in autumn 2023.\r\n\r\nOpening days 2022:\r\n\u2013 17 & 18\/09: Heritage days\r\nconcert, performance, guided tour\r\n\u2013 Each 1st Sunday of the month (2 October, 6 November, and 4 December)\r\nOpening hours: 10 a.m.-6 p.m.\r\nGuided tours: \u201cArchitecture & History\u201d, 2 p.m.\r\n\u2013 22 & 23 Oct (Archiweek)\r\nGuided tours\r\n\u2013 Book a guided tour at another time (contact us)","performers":"Partners of the beguinage restoration project\r\n\u2013 Municipality of Anderlecht (Contracting authority)\r\n\u2013 Urban.brussels (subsidising authority and technical consultant)\r\n\u2013 Erasmus House & Beguinage municipal museums\r\n\u2013 Arter (architecture & planning consultancy)\r\n\u2013 Arthur Vandendorpe (contractor)\r\n\u2013 CReA-Patrimoine (ULB), ULg\r\n\u2013 IRPA","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum\/en\/2022\/08\/1718-09-re-opening-of-the-anderlecht-beguinage-heritage-days\/","email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541298"},"de":{"name":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541298"},"it":{"name":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541298"},"sp":{"name":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541298"},"pt":{"name":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541298"},"cn":{"name":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541298"}},"place":{"id":278807,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"B\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","address_street_name":"Rue du Chapelain","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue du Chapelain, 8","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"B\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","address_street_name":"Kapelaansstraat","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Kapelaansstraat, 8","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"B\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","address_street_name":"Rue du Chapelain","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue du Chapelain, 8","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"B\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","address_street_name":"Rue du Chapelain","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue du Chapelain, 8","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"B\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","address_street_name":"Rue du Chapelain","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue du Chapelain, 8","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"B\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","address_street_name":"Rue du Chapelain","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue du Chapelain, 8","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"B\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","address_street_name":"Rue du Chapelain","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue du Chapelain, 8","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"B\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","address_street_name":"Rue du Chapelain","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue du Chapelain, 8","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[23],"translations":{"fr":["Ouest"],"nl":["West"],"en":["West"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":38807,"location":{"lat":50.83702417,"lon":4.30631243},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-09-08T15:35:22+02:00","published_at":"2022-06-10T14:17:22+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":8600,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"\u00c9rasme a s\u00e9journ\u00e9 en 1521 dans cette maison gothique (1450-1515) qui rassemble \u00e0\r\nla fois une collection de peintures, gravures et scuptures (Albrecht Du\u0308rer, Joos Van\r\nCleve, Pieter Huys, Cornelis Metsys, Frans Francken le Jeune \u2026), une biblioth\u00e8que\r\nsp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans les \u00e9ditions princeps, c\u2019est-\u00e0-dire les premi\u00e8res \u00e9ditions d\u2019une \u0153uvre\r\nchez diff\u00e9rents imprimeurs, un Jardin philosophique et un Jardin de plantes\r\nm\u00e9dicinales. Le mus\u00e9e publie des livres et organise des conf\u00e9rences, des concerts,\r\ndes expositions d\u2019art contemporain et historiques, des activit\u00e9s p\u00e9dagogiques, des\r\nvisites guid\u00e9es pour groupes.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Erasmushuis","address_street_name":"Formanoirstraat","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Formanoirstraat, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"In 1521 verbleef Erasmus in dit gotische huis (1450-1515) waar zich niet alleen een collectie bevindt van schilderijen, prenten en beeldhouwwerken (Albrecht Du\u0308rer, Joos\r\nVan Cleve, Pieter Huys, Cornelis Metsys, Frans Francken de Jongere\u2026), maar ook een\r\nbibliotheek gespecialiseerd in \u2018editiones principes\u2019, dat wil zeggen de eerste uitgaven\r\nvan een werk bij verschillende drukkers. Verder bevindt zich buiten nog een Filosofische\r\ntuin en een tuin met Geneeskrachtige planten.\r\nDaarnaast publiceert het museum boeken en organiseert voordrachten, concerten,\r\ntentoonstellingen met een historisch thema en tentoonstellingen Hedendaagse kunst,\r\npedagogische activiteiten en rondleidingen voor groepen.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Erasmus House","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"For several years, this house, which looks like a cloister, was home to the brilliant 16th-century humanist. Works of art, engravings, books, and archives bear witness to life in that era. End your visit in the philosophical and medicinal garden.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Museum des Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"Das \u201eMaison d\u2019Erasme\u201c in der Br\u00fcsseler Gemeinde Anderlecht wurde Ende des 15. Jahrhunderts im Auftrag eines Stiftsherrn der nahegelegenen Stiftskirche St. Peter und St. Guido  im sp\u00e4tgotischen Stil errichtet.\r\n\r\nDas Haus beherbergte im Jahr 1521 den bedeutenden niederl\u00e4ndischen Gelehrten des Renaissance-Humanismus Erasmus von Rotterdam, der hier, fernab von den gro\u00dfen Machtzentren und den dort herrschenden Religionskriegen, die Ruhe und Abgeschiedenheit der Natur suchte.\r\n\r\nDas im Maison d\u2019Erasme untergebrachte Museum zeigt sowohl eine Gem\u00e4ldesammlung mit Werken von Holbein, Bosch und Metsys als auch eine reich mit alten B\u00fccherausgaben best\u00fcckte Bibliothek. Der umliegende Garten besteht aus einem \u201eJardin des Maladies\u201c \u2013 dem \u201eGarten der Krankheiten\u201c mit zahlreichen Heilpflanzen \u2013 und einem \u201eJardin philosophique\u201c \u2013 dem \u201ePhilosophischen Garten\u201c.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Casa di Erasmo","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"La Casa di Erasmo deve il suo nome e la sua fama ad Erasmo da Rotterdam, che vi soggiorn\u00f2 nel 1521. Divenuta un museo dedicato al grande umanista rinascimentale, \u00e8 luogo di esposizione di una collezione unica composta da opere d'arte - sculture e dipinti di maestri fiamminghi -, mobili e libri antichi, molti dei quali scritti dallo stesso Erasmo. Se la Casa di Erasmo \u00e8 una delle pi\u00f9 antiche di Bruxelles - costruita in tre fasi nel corso dei secoli XV e XVI -, nel 1932 \u00e8 stata oggetto di un restauro completo voluto, nello spirito del pi\u00f9 puro storicismo, da Daniel Van Damme, fondatore del museo, con l'aiuto dell'architetto Charles Van Elst, che costru\u00ec anche la casa di Maurice Car\u00eame.  Gli spazi interni sono stati poi riconvertiti in sale del museo. Queste sono state decorate (una stanza con le pareti completamente rivestite di sontuose pelli di Cordoba) ed arredate con mobili provenienti dall'antica collezione del Ministro Vandenpeereboom. Gli interni sono quindi ricostruzioni con lo scopo di dare ai visitatori un'idea di quello che poteva essere una residenza rinascimentale. Le ricostruzioni sono in parte basate su documenti storici (lo studio di Erasmo che d\u00e0 sul giardino) ed in parte su ritrovamenti archeologici quali lo splendido fregio affrescato del primo piano. Nella parte posteriore della casa, un ampio giardino ombreggiato da grandi alberi conserva alcuni resti archeologici dell'antico castello di Anderlecht, poeticamente abbinati a diverse installazioni di artisti contemporanei. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Casa de Erasmo","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"La Casa de Erasmo debe su nombre y prestigio a la temporada que pas\u00f3 en ella Erasmo de R\u00f3terdam en 1521. Convertida en un museo dedicado a este gran humanista del Renacimiento, es el envoltorio de una colecci\u00f3n \u00fanica compuesta por obras de arte (esculturas y pinturas de maestros flamencos), muebles y libros antiguos, entre ellos numerosas ediciones erasmianas. Si la Casa de Erasmo es una de las m\u00e1s antiguas de Bruselas (construida en tres fases a lo largo de los siglos XV y XVI), a partir de 1932 fue objeto de una restauraci\u00f3n completa llevada a cabo, en el m\u00e1s puro historicismo, por Daniel Van Damme, fundador del museo, con la ayuda del arquitecto Charles Van Elst, que tambi\u00e9n construy\u00f3 la casa de Maurice Car\u00eame. Los espacios interiores se reorganizaron entonces en salas de museo que fueron decoradas (entre ellas, una sala con las paredes totalmente cubiertas por suntuosas pieles de C\u00f3rdoba) y amuebladas con mobiliario procedente de la antigua colecci\u00f3n del ministro Vandenpeereboom. El interior es, por tanto, una reproducci\u00f3n cuyo fin es dar a los visitantes la idea de lo que podr\u00eda haber sido una residencia en el Renacimiento, basada en parte en documentos hist\u00f3ricos (despacho de Erasmo frente al jard\u00edn) y en hallazgos arqueol\u00f3gicos como el maravilloso friso pintado al fresco del primer piso. Detr\u00e1s de la casa, un vasto jard\u00edn con grandes \u00e1rboles que le dan sombra conserva algunos restos arqueol\u00f3gicos del antiguo castillo de Anderlecht, los cuales se encuentran, po\u00e9ticamente, cerca de varias instalaciones de artistas contempor\u00e1neos. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":327,"location":{"lat":50.83592263,"lon":4.3077579},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-09-08T15:35:22+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:26+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/4310506c0a8c20ba3f229e4a161818048ab78c96.jpg","width":899,"height":899,"ratio":1,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":null}}},{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/d67eb9e1cd4a15f5264feb48476555e42acc058a.jpg","width":1181,"height":945,"ratio":1.25,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":"\u00a9Jonathan Ortegat and Erasmus House & Beguinage museums"},"nl":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":"\u00a9Jonathan Ortegat and Erasmus House & Beguinage museums"},"en":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":"\u00a9Jonathan Ortegat and Erasmus House & Beguinage museums"}}},{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/1a9bbbb20b14042b650465ae015d40cef3fbefed.jpg","width":945,"height":1181,"ratio":0.8,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":"\u00a9Jonathan Ortegat and Erasmus House & Beguinage museums"},"nl":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":"\u00a9Jonathan Ortegat and Erasmus House & Beguinage museums"},"en":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":"\u00a9Jonathan Ortegat and Erasmus House & Beguinage museums"}}},{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/6350e8e6270c0328a7cfdf3923540c9f6a3db4b8.jpg","width":945,"height":1181,"ratio":0.8,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":"\u00a9Jonathan Ortegat and Erasmus House & Beguinage museums"},"nl":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":"\u00a9Jonathan Ortegat and Erasmus House & Beguinage museums"},"en":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":"\u00a9Jonathan Ortegat and Erasmus House & Beguinage museums"}}},{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/18d4483d6484939508d50208260d10c7ecdc2b0d.jpg","width":945,"height":1181,"ratio":0.8,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":"\u00a9Jonathan Ortegat and Erasmus House & Beguinage museums"},"nl":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":"\u00a9Jonathan Ortegat and Erasmus House & Beguinage museums"},"en":{"title":"R\u00e9ouverture du b\u00e9guinage d'Anderlecht","copyright":"\u00a9Jonathan Ortegat and Erasmus House & Beguinage museums"}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-09-17","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"18:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-09-18","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"18:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-10-02","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"18:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-10-22","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"18:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-10-23","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"18:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-11-06","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"18:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-12-04","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"18:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":1},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Enfants"},"nl":{"name":"Kinderen"},"en":{"name":"Children"}},"value":0},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,259,263],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Chien d'assistance","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen"],"en":["Accessible","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-09-08T15:35:22+02:00","published_at":"2022-09-08T15:20:14+02:00","backoffice_id":261298,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.21129929348218},{"id":535582,"date_start":"2022-06-18","date_end":"2022-10-08","date_next":"2022-09-17","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations"}},"others":{"list":[99],"translations":{"fr":["Gastronomie"],"nl":["Gastronomie"],"en":["Gastronomy"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Summer Menu Coffee Tours","shortdescr":"Soyez pr\u00eat.e \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir des boissons cr\u00e9atives pour un vrai menu d\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9 lors de cette visite de 4 heures dans diff\u00e9rents quartiers de Bruxelles. Donn\u00e9 en FR & EN.","longdescr":"LES COFFEE TOURS\r\nLe caf\u00e9 de sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9 est en plein d\u00e9veloppement \u00e0 Bruxelles, avec l'\u00e9mergence de nouveaux caf\u00e9s et d'initiatives comme la Brussels Coffee Week, mais aussi gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019impl\u00e9mentation de grains de qualit\u00e9 dans de plus en plus de lieux HoReCa, \u00e9piceries etc. Le caf\u00e9 de sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9 reste malgr\u00e9 tout encore bien trop m\u00e9connu, il est temps d'explorer ce que la capitale de l'Europe a \u00e0 offrir.\r\n\r\nCes explorations caf\u00e9\u00efn\u00e9es de la ville sont aussi inhabituelles, amusantes qu\u2019instructives et correspondent \u00e0 un cours de base complet sur le caf\u00e9, le fun et la marche en plus.\r\n\r\nPOUR QUI\r\nLes Brussels Coffee Tours s'adressent \u00e0 tout le monde, avec un focus sur l\u2019exp\u00e9rience consommateur\/coffee lovers d\u00e9sireu.x.ses de mieux comprendre leur boisson favorite.\r\n\r\nIl convient \u00e9galement aux professionnel.le.s de l\u2019HoReCa qui encore souvent ignorent ce qu\u2019est le caf\u00e9 de sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9, les aidant ainsi \u00e0 comprendre le parent pauvre de leur secteur mais aussi \u00e0 mieux appr\u00e9hender l\u2019exp\u00e9rience client li\u00e9e au caf\u00e9.\r\n\r\nJe suis l\u00e0 pour aider et esp\u00e8re combler le foss\u00e9 entre les amateurs et les professionnels. Aucun pr\u00e9requis n'est n\u00e9cessaire \u00e0 ce tour.\r\n\r\nOBJECTIF\r\nLe but des Brussels Coffee Tours est de faire d\u00e9couvrir les lieux innovants lorsqu\u2019il est question de caf\u00e9 de sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9, mais aussi de d\u00e9couvrir et comprendre comment consommer \/ go\u00fbter le caf\u00e9 sur base de crit\u00e8res de qualit\u00e9 objectifs.\r\n\r\nComprendre la cha\u00eene de production du champ \u00e0 la tasse, la diff\u00e9rence entre caf\u00e9 de sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9 et caf\u00e9 de commodit\u00e9 et apprendre \u00e0 mieux acheter son caf\u00e9 sont \u00e9galement au c\u0153ur des objectifs des Coffee Tours.\r\n\r\nSUMMER MENU TOUR, UN TOUR P\u00c9DAGOGIQUE ! \r\nLors des - SUMMER MENU TOURS - , nous explorerons la partie froide d\u2019un menu, en passant du Cold Brew - extraction de caf\u00e9 \u00e0 froid, tendance num\u00e9ro 1 dans les pays anglo-saxons - \u00e0 l\u2019Espresso on Ice, mais aussi en explorant d\u2019autres boissons parfois sans caf\u00e9ine, faisant preuve de beaucoup de cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9, pour enfin sortir du home made ice tea. Comme lors de chaque Coffee Tour, nous parlerons de caf\u00e9 de sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9 aussi, afin de mieux vous \u00e9clairer sur le sujet. Entre innovation, gourmandise et philosophie, l\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9 est l\u00e0 et \u00e7a fait du bien ! PS: vous ne payez pas d'extra pour vos boissons.\r\n\r\nLors de l'\u00e9dition MIDTOWN nous visitons 5 \u00e0 6 lieux entre le haut du Mont des Arts et le centre ville. Nous go\u00fbterons du Cold Brew mais aussi du Cold Drip ainsi que des boissons au poivre - de sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9!! - ou encore des d\u00e9lices \u00e0 la lavande, On Ice bien s\u00fbr.\r\n\r\nLors de l'\u00e9dition UPTOWN TRINIT\u00c9, nous visitons 6 lieux dans le haut de Saint-Gilles. Nous go\u00fbterons m\u00eame du caffe latte en canette, infus\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019azote, mais aussi une limonade de cerise de caf\u00e9 ou encore une horchata \u00e0 la mexicaine.\r\n\r\nNous vous sensibiliserons aux m\u00e9tiers du caf\u00e9 et aborderons diff\u00e9rents sujets tels que : les diff\u00e9rences de philosophies et les nouvelles vagues, les m\u00e9thodes de pr\u00e9paration, les habitudes de consommation, le m\u00e9tier de barista, les extractions \u00e0 froid, la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 dans les menus \u00e9t\u00e9, le go\u00fbt, la qualit\u00e9, le caf\u00e9 de sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9, les labels, les styles de torr\u00e9faction, les recettes etc\u2026 mais aussi les informations \u00e0 d\u00e9crypter sur les sachets de caf\u00e9 afin de mieux acheter et d\u00e9jouer le marketing global.\r\n\r\nGOOD TO KNOW\r\nLes tours se passent toujours en ext\u00e9rieur.\r\n\r\nNous marchons d'un endroit \u00e0 l'autre et jetons un \u0153il aux lieux, mais les groupes \u00e9tant grands par rapport \u00e0 la capacit\u00e9 des lieux, nous ne consommons pas assis \u00e0 l\u2019int\u00e9rieur.\r\n\r\nIl est pr\u00e9f\u00e9rable de se munir de chaussures confortables, de v\u00eatements CHAUDS en hiver (mieux vaut trop de couches que pas assez !!) et un parapluie en cas de pluie. De l\u2019eau est toujours recommand\u00e9e \u00e9galement. Masque et gel en temps de Covid.\r\n\r\nPetit d\u00e9jeunez avant la visite car nous n'avons pas le temps de manger lors des tours.\r\nPssst, rejoins-nous : INSTA @ok_coffee_tips","performers":"Thomas Wyngaard est fondateur de OK Coffee et un des rares experts en Caf\u00e9 de Sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9 en Belgique francophone. Il est consultant ind\u00e9pendant, enseignant (certifi\u00e9 par la Specialty Coffee Association de janvier 2018 \u00e0 avril 2021), tour-ist et broadcaster.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.okcoffee.tips","email":"thomas@okcoffee.tips","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.535582"},"nl":{"name":"Summer Menu Coffee Tours","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.535582"},"en":{"name":"Summer Menu Coffee Tours","shortdescr":"Be ready to discover and taste creative summer beverages, caffeinated or not, during this 4 hours tour in Brussels areas. Hosted in FR & EN.","longdescr":"THE COFFEE TOURS\r\nSpecialty coffee is booming in Brussels, with the emergence of new coffee shops and initiatives like the Brussels Coffee Week, but also thanks to the implementation of quality beans in more and more HoReCa places, grocery stores etc. However, specialty coffee is still far too unknown. Now is the time to explore what the capital city of Europe has to offer.\r\n\r\nThese caffeinated explorations of the city are unusual, fun as they are highly informative, and match a complete coffee basics course, with an extra sprinkle of fun and walking.\r\n\r\nFOR WHO\r\nThe Brussels Coffee Tours are for everyone, with a focus on the consumer\/coffee lover experience to better understand your favorite beverage!\r\n\r\nIt is also suitable for HoReCa professionals who are often still unaware of what specialty coffee is, helping them to understand the poor relation of their sector but also to better understand the customer experience related to coffee.\r\n\r\nI'm here to help and hope to bridge the gap between the amateurs and the professionals. No prerequisites are necessary for this tour.\r\n\r\nOBJECTIVE\r\nThe goal of the Brussels Coffee Tours is to discover innovative places when it comes to specialty coffee, but also to discover and understand how to consume\/taste coffee based on objective quality criteria.\r\n\r\nUnderstanding the production chain from field to cup, the difference between specialty and commodity coffee, and learning how to better buy coffee are also central to the objectives of the Coffee Tours.\r\n\r\nSUMMER MENU TOUR, AN EDUCATIONAL TOUR! \r\nDuring the SUMMER MENU TOURS, we will explore the cold part of a menu, from Cold Brew to Espresso on Ice, but also by exploring other drinks, sometimes without caffeine, showing a lot of creativity, to finally get out of the home made ice tea. As with every Coffee Tour, we will also talk about specialty coffee, to better enlighten you on the subject. Between innovation, gourmandise and philosophy, summer is here and it feels good! PS: you don't pay extra for your drinks.\r\n\r\nDuring the MIDTOWN edition, we visit 5 to 6 locations between the top of the Mont des Arts to Downtown. We will taste Cold Brew but also Cold Drip as well as pepper drinks - specialty pepper please! - or even lavender delights, On Ice of course.\r\n\r\nDuring the UPTOWN TRINIT\u00c9 edition, we visit 6 places in the upper Saint-Gilles. We'll even taste caffe latte in a can, infused with nitrogen, but also a coffee cherry lemonade or a Mexican-style horchata.\r\n\r\nWe will bring awareness on the coffee business and discuss different topics such as: the differences in philosophies and new waves, preparation methods, consumption habits, the barista's profession, cold extraction, creativity in summer menus, taste, quality, specialty coffee, labels, roasting styles, recipes etc... but also information to decipher on coffee bags in order to buy better and outsmart global marketing.\r\n\r\nGOOD TO KNOW\r\nThe tours always take place outdoors.\r\n\r\nWe walk from one place to another and have a look at the places, but the groups being large compared to the capacity of the places, we do not consume sitting inside.\r\n\r\nIt is best to bring comfortable shoes and an umbrella in case of rain. Water is always recommended as well. Mask and gel in Covid times.\r\n\r\nHave breakfast beforehand because we don't have time to eat during the tours.\r\nPssst, join us: INSTA @ok_coffee_tips","performers":"Thomas Wyngaard is the founder of OK Coffee and one of the few Specialty Coffee experts in French-speaking Belgium. He is an independent consultant, teacher (certified by the Specialty Coffee Association from January 2018 to April 2021), tour-ist and broadcaster.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.535582"},"de":{"name":"Summer Menu Coffee Tours","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.535582"},"it":{"name":"Summer Menu Coffee Tours","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.535582"},"sp":{"name":"Summer Menu Coffee Tours","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.535582"},"pt":{"name":"Summer Menu Coffee Tours","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.535582"},"cn":{"name":"Summer Menu Coffee Tours","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":nul