Zaterdagtour","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Paul Deschanellaan","address_street_number":"143","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaarbeek","address_line1":"Paul Deschanellaan, 143","address_line2":"1030 Schaarbeek","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo is een Brusselse vereniging van lokale vrijwilligersgidsen met een hart voor Brussel en de fiets.\r\nHun passie voor de stad en de fiets delen ze met veel enthousiasme met bezoekers van de stad en andere Brusselaars. Ze bieden een authentieke ervaring en kennismaking met Brussel en vinden met de fiets het ideale ritme om je onder te dompelen in het veelzijdige Brussel. Liefst van al gidsen ze je langs de minder begane paden de stad in een gemoedelijke sfeer. Beleef Brussel ten volle met te fiets en ontdek meer dan je verwacht!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Avenue Paul Deschanel","address_street_number":"143","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Avenue Paul Deschanel, 143","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Cactus is a committed group of Brussels residents with a passion for the city and the bike. With an open-minded view on the city our guides set to work with the many possibilities, dynamics and diversity of the city. They make visitors experience this vibrant and complex city. During our guided bike tours, we aim for a convivial atmosphere with space for interaction and encounters. We opt for the bicycle as it is the ideal way to (re)discover Brussels and to move around in the city.\r\nExperience Brussels to the fullest and discover more than you expect!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Avenue Paul Deschanel","address_street_number":"143","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Avenue Paul Deschanel, 143","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Avenue Paul Deschanel","address_street_number":"143","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Avenue Paul Deschanel, 143","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Avenue Paul Deschanel","address_street_number":"143","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Avenue Paul Deschanel, 143","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Avenue Paul Deschanel","address_street_number":"143","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"pho