es 22 et 23 septembre 2022. Pour sa premi\u00e8re \u00e9dition, une soir\u00e9e de lancement aura \u00e9galement lieu le 17 juin. Ce nouveau concept f\u00e9ministe et \u00e9co-responsable est une initiative de Beats'n'roots. Son objectif principal est de mettre en avant les femmes et les personnes issues des minorit\u00e9s de genre, trop souvent oubli\u00e9es ou mises de c\u00f4t\u00e9, le but est de leur donner plus de visibilit\u00e9.","performers":"Les artistes pr\u00e9sent\u00b7es durant le festival seront d\u00e9voil\u00e9\u00b7es lors de la soir\u00e9e de lancement du 17 juin.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bru-x-elles-festival.be\/","email":"com@bru-x-elles-festival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532273"},"nl":{"name":"Bru\u00b7X\u00b7elles Festival","shortdescr":"Het eerste hybride muziekshowcasefestival dat zich richt op vrouwelijke en minderheidsartiesten. 100% made in Brussel met een internationale reikwijdte.","longdescr":"Het Bru\u00b7X\u00b7elles Festival is een evenement gemaakt door en voor vrouwen en mensen uit genderminderheden. Het vindt plaats in het hart van Brussel op 22 en 23 september 2022.","performers":"De artiesten die tijdens het festival optreden worden bekendgemaakt op de openingsavond op 17 juni.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532273"},"en":{"name":"Bru\u00b7X\u00b7elles Festival","shortdescr":"The first hybrid music showcase festival focusing on women and minority artists. 100% made in Brussels with an international scope.","longdescr":"The Bru\u00b7X\u00b7elles Festival is an event made by and for women and people from gender minorities. In the heart of Brussels, it will be held on September 22 and 23, 2022.\r\nFor its first edition, a launch party will also take place on June 17. This new feminist and eco-responsible concept is an initiative of Beats'n'roots.  Its main objective is to highlight women and people from gender minorities, too often forgotten or set aside, the goal is to give them more visibility.","performers":"The artists featured during the festival will be announced at the launch party on 17 June.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532273"},"de":{"name":"Bru\u00b7X\u00b7elles Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532273"},"it":{"name":"Bru\u00b7X\u00b7elles Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532273"},"sp":{"name":"Bru\u00b7X\u00b7elles Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532273"},"pt":{"name":"Bru\u00b7X\u00b7elles Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532273"},"cn":{"name":"Bru\u00b7X\u00b7elles Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.532273"}},"place":{"id":247435,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"GC De Vaartkapoen","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"devaartkapoen@vgc.be","website":"http:\/\/www.vaartkapoen.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 413 04 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"En mai 2019, le centre culturel n\u00e9erlandophone VK a quitt\u00e9 sa location famili\u00e8re dans la rue de l'Ecole pour des travaux de r\u00e9novation. \r\nPendant deux ans, ils occuperont l'ancienne imprimerie de la Rue de Manchester 13-15 \u00e0 Molenbeek","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"GC De Vaartkapoen","address_street_name":"Manchesterstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"devaartkapoen@vgc.be","website":"http:\/\/www.vaartkapoen.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 413 04 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","address_line1":"Manchesterstraat","address_line2":"1080 Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","description_web":"In mei 2019 verliet de VK voor renovatiewerken haar vertrouwde stek in de Schoolstraat.\r\nGedurende twee jaar bezetten ze de voormalige drukkerij in Manchesterstraat 13-15.\r\n\r\nDe Vaartkapoen is in volle verbouwing!\r\n\r\nIn 2019 gingen de werken van start, om in 2022 de deuren te openen van een vernieuwd gemeenschapscentrum \u00e9n een splinternieuwe concertzaal. Er komt ook een tuin die toegankelijk is voor de hele buurt. Tijdens de verbouwingen kan je tot 2022 terecht in Manchesterstraat 13-15 voor alle concerten, activiteiten en workshops van de VK. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"GC De Vaartkapoen","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"devaartkapoen@vgc.be","website":"http:\/\/www.vaartkapoen.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 413 04 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"10