scr":"Certains dimanches de l'\u00e9t\u00e9, Arkadia vous guidera gratuitement dans plusieurs parcs de Bruxelles !","longdescr":"Certains dimanches de l'\u00e9t\u00e9, Arkadia vous guidera gratuitement dans plusieurs parcs de Bruxelles !\nAu d\u00e9part de la Guinguette Parc du Duden - Bar Duden, un guide Arkadia vous fera d\u00e9couvrir l'histoire du parc et de son environnement proche. Il abordera aussi des notions d'\u00e9cologie. Des visites sp\u00e9cialement ax\u00e9es sur l'environnement pour sensibiliser les habitants au respect des espaces verts en ville et au respect de l'environnement :)\nRDV avec le guide, au Square Lain\u00e9.R\u00e9servation fortement conseill\u00e9e car les places sont limit\u00e9es! Merci de nous pr\u00e9venir par mail en cas de d\u00e9sistement de derni\u00e8re minute.En cas de pluie les visites sont maintenues.\nCette visite vous est offerte par Bruxelles Environnement - Leefmilieu Brussel","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.arkadia.be","email":"info@arkadia.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536245"},"nl":{"name":"PARK TOUR : Visites gratuites du Parc Duden","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/nl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536245"},"en":{"name":"PARK TOUR : Visites gratuites du Parc Duden","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/en","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536245"},"de":{"name":"PARK TOUR : Visites gratuites du Parc Duden","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536245"},"it":{"name":"PARK TOUR : Visites gratuites du Parc Duden","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536245"},"sp":{"name":"PARK TOUR : Visites gratuites du Parc Duden","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536245"},"pt":{"name":"PARK TOUR : Visites gratuites du Parc Duden","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536245"},"cn":{"name":"PARK TOUR : Visites gratuites du Parc Duden","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536245"}},"place":{"id":245161,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Parc Duden","address_street_name":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Le parc Duden, le poumon vert de Forest, maintient le pass\u00e9 forestier de cette commune. Au Moyen-\u00c2ge, il faisait partie du bois de la Heegde, qui appartenait \u00e0 l\u2019abbaye b\u00e9n\u00e9dictine de Forest. Au XIXe si\u00e8cle, Guillaume Duden, riche n\u00e9gociant en dentelles, devient propri\u00e9taire du site. Il y fait construire une demeure n\u00e9oclassique et d\u2019autres infrastructures, comme des ponts et des escaliers, qui apportent une touche pittoresque au parc.\r\n\r\nLe ch\u00e2teau Duden est aujourd\u2019hui occup\u00e9 par l\u2019INRACI-NARAFI (l\u2019ancien Institut de Radio\u00e9lectricit\u00e9 et de Cin\u00e9matographie). L\u2019entr\u00e9e est prot\u00e9g\u00e9e par une marquise en verre en forme de baldaquin, et l\u2019arri\u00e8re est orn\u00e9 de deux tours. D\u00e9couvrez les \u00e9curies, \u00e0 l\u2019apparence d\u2019un petit ch\u00e2teau avec sa tour d\u2019escalier et ses lucarnes surmont\u00e9es de clochetons ; et passez devant la conciergerie de style n\u00e9o-Renaissance flamande. Dans le parc, retrouvez une croix en pierre et un arc-en-ciel en fer du sculpteur italien renomm\u00e9 Mauro Staccioli.\r\n\r\nBaladez-vous aussi dans le parc de Forest, reli\u00e9 au parc Duden par le parc Jupiter.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Dudenpark","address_street_name":"Victor Rousseaulaan","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Vorst","address_line1":"Victor Rousseaulaan","address_line2":"1190 Vorst","description_web":"De Dudenpark is de groene long van Vorst. Je merkt het meteen: deze gemeente heeft een bosverleden. In de Middeleeuwen lag hier het Heegdebos. Dat hoorde bij de Abdij van Vorst. In de 19e eeuw werd Guillaume Duden, een rijke handelaar in kant, eigenaar van de site. Hij bouwde er een neoklassieke residentie en zorgde voor bruggen en trappen om er een echt pittoresk park van te maken.\r\n\r\nTegenwoordig zit de school INRACI-NARAFI in het Dudenkasteel. Let op de ingang. Daar zie je een glazen luifel in de vorm van een baldakijn. Zie je de stallen met hun traptoren en dakkapellen? Net een kasteel. Loop zeker ook langs de conciergerie in Vlaamse neorenaissance. In het park staat ook een stenen kruis en een ijzeren regenboog van de bekende Italiaanse beeldhouwer Mauro Staccioli. Maar het pronkstuk vind je helemaal onderaan. Daar ligt het Joseph Mari\u00ebnstadion, de thuishaven van de populaire voetbalclub Union Saint-Gilloise. Voor veel voetballiefhebbers is dit het mooiste stadion ter wereld. Niet alleen vanwege zijn unieke ligging. Maar ook vanwege zijn prachtige, beschermde, art-decogevel en glasramen.\r\n\r\nWandel zeker ook eens naar het Park van Vorst. Dat is met het Dudenpark verbonden door het Jupiterpark.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Duden Park","address_street_name":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Duden Park, the green lung of Forest, keeps the woodland history of this commune alive. In the Middle Ages, it was part of the Heegde woods, which belonged to the Benedictine abbey of Forest. In the 19th century, Guillaume Duden, a wealthy lace merchant, became the owner of the site. He built a neoclassical house and other infrastructure, such as bridges and staircases, which added a picturesque touch to the park.\r\n\r\nCh\u00e2teau Duden is now home to INRACI-NARAFI (the former Institute of Radio-electricity and Cinematography). The entrance is protected by a glass canopy in the form of a baldachin, and the rear is decorated with two towers. Discover the stables, which have the appearance of a small castle with their stair tower and dormer windows topped with bell towers; and pass by the Flemish neo-Renaissance conciergerie. In the park you\u2019ll find a stone cross and an iron rainbow by renowned Italian sculptor Mauro Staccioli.\r\n\r\nYou can also take a walk in Forest Park, which is connected to Duden Park by Jupiter Park.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Parc Duden","address_street_name":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Der Parc Duden, die gr\u00fcne Lunge von Forest, ist ein letzter Zeuge der forstwirtschaftlichen Vergangenheit der Gemeinde. Im Mittelalter war er Teil des Waldst\u00fccks Bois de la Heegde, der wiederum zur Benediktinerabtei von Forest geh\u00f6rte. Im 19. Jahrhundert erwarb der wohlhabende Spitzenh\u00e4ndler Guillaume Duden das Gel\u00e4nde. Er lie\u00df ein neoklassizistisches Herrenhaus und andere Elemente, wie Br\u00fccken und Treppen, errichten, die dem Park bis heute eine malerische Note verleihen.\r\n\r\nDas Ch\u00e2teau Duden beherbergt heute das INRACI-NARAFI (das ehemalige Institut f\u00fcr Radioelektrik und Kinematografie). Der Eingang wird von einem Baldachin-\u00e4hnlichen Glasvordach \u00fcberragt, w\u00e4hrend die R\u00fcckseite von zwei T\u00fcrmen geschm\u00fcckt ist. Bewundern Sie die Stallungen, die mit ihrem Treppenturm und den von Glockent\u00fcrmen gekr\u00f6nten Oberlichtern ihrerseits wie ein kleines Schloss anmuten, und werfen Sie einen Blick auf das Pf\u00f6rtnerhaus im fl\u00e4mischen Neo-Renaissance-Stil. Im Park finden Sie zudem ein steinernes Kreuz und einen eisernen Regenbogen des renommierten italienischen Bildhauers Mauro Staccioli.\r\n\r\nFortsetzen k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihren Spaziergang im Parc de Forest, der \u00fcber den Parc Jupiter mit dem Parc Duden verbunden ist.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Parc Duden","address_street_name":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Parc Duden","address_street_name":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Parc Duden","address_street_name":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Parc Duden","address_street_name":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Victor Rousseau","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":7437,"location":{"lat":50.81073747,"lon":4.32234062},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-09-09T04:05:38+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:22:08+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":276946,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Depuis 1983, Arkadia explore les richesses du patrimoine belge et bruxellois et d\u00e9veloppe de nombreux projets culturels sp\u00e9cialement \u00e0 Bruxelles, entre architecture, urbanisme, culture, arts plastiques et id\u00e9ologie depuis le Moyen \u00c2ge jusqu\u2019\u00e0 nos jours. Voir et comprendre la ville et son d\u00e9veloppement architectural, approcher la cr\u00e9ation artistique et lui donner un sens, telles sont les activit\u00e9s que l'ASBL veut partager avec le public. Sp\u00e9cialistes du patrimoine  architectural et de l'art contemporain, ils font d\u00e9couvrir la ville \u00e0 travers des visites guid\u00e9es et des conf\u00e9rences en plusieurs langues.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Naamsestraat","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/nl","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Naamsestraat, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Sinds 1983 verkent Arkadia de rijkdom van het Belgische en Brusselse erfgoed en ontwikkelt talrijke culturele projecten, vooral in Brussel, tussen architectuur, stedenbouw, cultuur, plastische kunsten en ideologie, van de Middeleeuwen tot vandaag. De stad en haar architecturale ontwikkeling zien en begrijpen, de artistieke creatie benaderen en er een betekenis aan geven, dat zijn de activiteiten die de VZW met het publiek wil delen. Zij zijn gespecialiseerd in architectonisch erfgoed en hedendaagse kunst en laten de stad zien door middel van rondleidingen en lezingen in verschillende talen.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Since 1983, Arkadia has been exploring the richness of Belgium's and Brussels' heritage and developing numerous cultural projects especially in Brussels, between architecture, urbanism, culture, plastic arts and ideology from the Middle Ages to the present day. Seeing and understanding the city and its architectural development, approaching artistic creation and giving it meaning, these are the activities that the ASBL wants to share with the public. Specialists in architectural heritage and contemporary art, they show the city through guided tours and lectures in several languages.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_vis