 brunch drag du Pentahotel Brussels City Centre ! Nous vous proposons un buffet \u00e0 couper le souffle, des plats d\u00e9licieux et des cocktails mimosa \u00e0 volont\u00e9, tandis que les reines du Cabaret Mademoiselle virevolteront, danseront et feront du Lip Sync.\r\n\r\nSi vous souhaitez oublier la grisaille, ne cherchez pas plus loin. L\u2019extravagance du brunch drag vous fera rire, danser et hurler comme UNE REEEEINE !\r\n\r\nVous ne trouverez rien de semblable ailleurs. Inscrivez vous d\u00e8s maintenant ! Les places sont limit\u00e9es :  https:\/\/bit.ly\/3w71MW4\r\n\r\nUn brunch r\u00e9serv\u00e9 aux oiseaux rares !","performers":"Avec les artistes du Cabaret Mademoiselle","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cabaretmademoiselle.be","email":"socialmedia@cabaretmademoiselle.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540131"},"nl":{"name":"LE BRUNCH DRAG: Mimosas and show","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540131"},"en":{"name":"LE BRUNCH DRAG: Mimosas and show","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540131"},"de":{"name":"LE BRUNCH DRAG: Mimosas and show","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540131"},"it":{"name":"LE BRUNCH DRAG: Mimosas and show","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/v