 et malentendantes","Chien d'assistance","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-08-31T14:05:03+02:00","published_at":"2022-08-24T15:09:25+02:00","backoffice_id":258234,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.26375528216591},{"id":538686,"date_start":"2022-09-30","date_end":"2022-09-30","date_next":"2022-09-30","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[4,8],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Chanson"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Chanson"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Song"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Lonny - Gravas \u2022 FrancoFaune 2022","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"LONNY (FR)\r\nN\u00e9e \u00e0 la montagne, grandie \u00e0 Paris, c\u2019est aussi au Qu\u00e9bec que Louise Lhermitte a d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 ses talents de musicienne. Son joyau de premier album, salu\u00e9 par la presse, Lonny l\u2019a d\u2019ailleurs enregistr\u00e9 au Canada sous la houlette de Jesse Mac Cormack, avant de faire appel \u00e0 Olivier Marguerit (O) pour les cordes et cuivres. D\u2019une since\u0301rite\u0301 spontane\u0301e et d\u2019une purete\u0301 intemporelle.\r\n#FolkAtmosph\u00e9rique #LonnyPlan\u00e8te #PasLaFilleDeBernard\r\n\r\nGRAVAS (BE)\r\nPeintre de formation, chanteuse par passion, Aur\u00e9lie Gravas d\u00e9cline ses envies musicales par petites touches expressionnistes et po\u00e9tiques. Port\u00e9es par des arrangements minimalistes, les chansons de Gravas se disent en fran\u00e7ais ou en anglais, mais toujours dans la spontan\u00e9it\u00e9. Percussionniste d'exception, l'artiste a \u00e9galement pr\u00eat\u00e9 sa voix aux ch\u0153urs d'Adamo, dEUS ou Zap Mama. D\u00e9sormais accompagn\u00e9e par Marc A. Huyghens (Venus, Joy) et Fran\u00e7oise Vidick (Joy), la chanteuse esquisse les courbes d'une musique personnelle et onirique \u00e0 souhait. \u00c0 d\u00e9couvrir, pour la premi\u00e8re fois, sur la sc\u00e8ne de la Maison des Musiques.\r\n#PopMinimaliste #ToutePremi\u00e8reFois #CostaGravas","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.francofaune.be\/","email":"info@francofaune.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538686"},"nl":{"name":"Lonny - Gravas \u2022 FrancoFaune 2022","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538686"},"en":{"name":"Lonny - Gravas \u2022 FrancoFaune 2022","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538686"},"de":{"name":"Lonny \u2022 Maison des musiques \u2022 FrancoFaune 2022","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538686"},"it":{"name":"Lonny \u2022 Maison des musiques \u2022 FrancoFaune 2022","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538686"},"sp":{"name":"Lonny \u2022 Maison des musiques \u2022 FrancoFaune 2022","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538686"},"pt":{"name":"Lonny \u2022 Maison des musiques \u2022 FrancoFaune 2022","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538686"},"cn":{"name":"Lonny \u2022 Maison des musiques \u2022 FrancoFaune 2022","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538686"}},"place":{"id":230123,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Maison des Musiques","address_street_name":"Rue Lebeau","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@conseildelamusique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.conseildelamusique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 550 13 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 550 13 20","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Lebeau, 39","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Id\u00e9alement situ\u00e9e, dans le quartier du Sablon \u00e0 Bruxelles, la Maison des Musiques est le lieu o\u00f9 se produisent de nombreux \u00e9v\u00e9nements \u00e0 l\u2019initiative du Conseil de la Musique.\r\n\r\nConcerts de musique classique & contemporaine en collaboration avec Chamber Music for Europe, concerts organis\u00e9s avec VKconcerts, spectacles pour enfants dans un cycle intitul\u00e9 Dimanches des Petits, Label Nights consacr\u00e9es \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte des labels de la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles, \u00e9tapes live du concours Du F. dans le texte : voil\u00e0 une partie du menu \u00e0 la carte de la Maison des Musiques chaque saison.\r\n\r\nLa Maison des Musiques accueille \u00e9galement de nombreuses r\u00e9sidences et autres showcases \u00e0 nature priv\u00e9e ou publique.\r\n\r\nLe Conseil de la Musique, via son service aux acteurs du secteur musical Musiscope y organise r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement des journ\u00e9es d'information ou des stages.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Maison des Musiques","address_street_name":"Lebeaustraat","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@conseildelamusique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.conseildelamusique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 209 10 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 550 13 20","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Lebeaustraat, 39","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Maison des Musiques","address_street_name":"Rue Lebeau","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@conseildelamusique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.conseildelamusique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 550 13 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 550 13 20","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Lebeau, 39","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Maison des Musiques","address_street_name":"Rue Lebeau","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@conseildelamusique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.conseildelamusique.be","phone_cont