h mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-09-05T01:06:58+02:00","published_at":"2022-06-27T15:37:26+02:00","backoffice_id":257130,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.16069202332988},{"id":524441,"date_start":"2022-01-04","date_end":"2022-12-06","date_next":"2022-10-04","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":84,"translations":{"fr":"Divers","nl":"Varia","en":"Various"}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en","es"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Repair Cafe des Marolles","shortdescr":"LE REPAIR CAFE DES MAROLLES se trouve AU CENTRE CULTUREL BRUEGEL, \u00e0 deux pas de la place du Jeu de Balle, TOUS LES PREMIERS MARDI DE CHAQUE MOIS de 17h30 \u00e0 21h.","longdescr":">> R\u00e9parer ensemble, c\u2019est l\u2019id\u00e9e des Repair Caf\u00e9s.\r\nVous apportez vos v\u00eatements, appareils \u00e9lectriques, vaisselle, objets utiles, bijoux, jouets, et autres.. ayant besoin d\u2019une r\u00e9paration.\r\nDes r\u00e9parateurs et r\u00e9paratrices b\u00e9n\u00e9voles experts en la mati\u00e8re (\u00e9lectriciens, couturiers, menuisiers, r\u00e9parateurs de v\u00e9los) sont pr\u00e9sents pour r\u00e9aliser ces petites r\u00e9parations tout en vous expliquant comment la r\u00e9aliser vous-m\u00eame dans le futur.\r\n\r\nPoint d'attention : Un seul objet \u00e0 r\u00e9parer sera accept\u00e9 par personne et par Repair Caf\u00e9.","performers":"Les fabuleux b\u00e9n\u00e9voles de 1000BXL en Transition","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/1000bxlentransition.be\/all-project-list\/repair-cafe-des-marolles\/","email":"1000bxlentransition@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 473 93 73 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.524441"},"nl":{"name":"Repair Cafe de Marollen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":">> Repair Caf\u00e9 dat is samen dingen herstellen. Breng je te herstellen kleding, elektrische apparaten, gebroken potten en pannen, speelgoed etc...Vrijwillige handige harry\u2019s, poppendokters en verstelkaboutertjes zullen je helpen kleine herstellingen uit te voeren terwijl ze je aanleren hoe je het zelf in de toekomst kan doen. Wie niets te herstellen heeft, komt gewoon langs, drinkt thee of koffie en verheugt zich bij het zien van zoveel leed dat geheeld wordt. Alles draait om een uitwisseling van kennis, kunde en glimlach.\r\n\r\nAttentie : Er zal \u00e9\u00e9n object per persoon per Repair Caf\u00e9 worden gerepareerd","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.524441"},"en":{"name":"Marolles' Repair Caf\u00e9","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.524441"},"de":{"name":"Repair Cafe des Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.524441"},"it":{"name":"Repair Cafe des Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.524441"},"sp":{"name":"Repair Cafe des Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.524441"},"pt":{"name":"Repair Cafe des Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.524441"},"cn":{"name":"Repair Cafe des Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.524441"}},"place":{"id":204305,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Centre Culturel Bruegel","address_street_name":"Rue des Renards","address_street_number":"1 F","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ccbruegel.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Renards, 1 F","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Situ\u00e9 dans un b\u00e2timent consacr\u00e9 \u00e0 la culture depuis le d\u00e9but du XXe si\u00e8cle, notamment salle de projections cin\u00e9matographiques en 1911, le Centre Culturel Bruegel, cr\u00e9\u00e9 en 1982, occupe une place de choix dans l\u2019embl\u00e9matique quartier des Marolles, avec une d\u00e9clinaison d\u2019activit\u00e9s jouant avant tout la carte de la proximit\u00e9.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"CC Bruegel","address_street_name":"Vossenstraat","address_street_number":"1 F","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ccbruegel.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Vossenstraat, 1 F","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Gevestigd in een gebouw gewijd aan cultuur sinds het begin van de twintigste eeuw (in 1911 fungeerde het reeds als particuliere filmprojectiezaal), neemt het Cultureel Centrum Bruegel, opgericht in 1982, een bijzondere plaats in in de karakteristieke wijk van de Marollen. De activiteiten zijn er in de eerste plaats op gericht om de diverse bevolkingsgroepen met verschillende culturele achtergronden intergenerationeel samen te brengen en de toegang tot cultuur te promoten.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre Culturel Bruegel","address_street_name":"Rue des Renards","address_street_number":"1 F","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ccbruegel.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue des Renards, 1 F","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Located in a building devoted to culture since the beginning of the 20th century, the Bruegel Cultural Centre, created in 1982, occupies a prominent position in the emblematic Marolles district. Through their activities they aim to bring together the diverse population groups of different cultural backgrounds and ages, and promote access to culture.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel Bruegel","address_street_name":"Rue des Renards","address_street_number":"1 F","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ccbruegel.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Renards, 1 F","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Centre Culturel Bruegel","address_street_name":"Rue des Renards","address_street_number":"1 F","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ccbruegel.be","website":"http:\/\/ww