tandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor blinde en slechtziende personen","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for blind and partially-sighted persons","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"]}},"facebook_link":"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/BELvuemuseum","publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-09-12T01:07:59+02:00","published_at":"2015-06-15T10:06:38+02:00","backoffice_id":81994,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.16757672110742},{"id":537970,"date_start":"2022-04-23","date_end":"2022-12-31","date_next":"2022-09-12","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours"}},"others":{"list":[112],"translations":{"fr":["Insolite"],"nl":["Ongewoon"],"en":["Unusual"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Si t\u2019y danses \u2013 balades urbaines","shortdescr":"D\u00e9couvrez l\u2019histoire de la danse de mani\u00e8re ludique et interactive et visitez des lieux insolites de Bruxelles gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019application mobile \"Si t\u2019y danses \u2013 balades urbaines\" !","longdescr":"Balades urbaines interactives l tout public l 1h15- 1h45\r\n\r\nT\u00e9l\u00e9chargeable gratuitement, l\u2019application mobile \u00ab\u00a0Si t\u2019y danses \u2013 balades urbaines\u00a0\u00bb propose une activit\u00e9 culturelle accessible \u00e0 tout moment qui invite \u00e0 poser un regard nouveau sur la ville et son patrimoine, tout en mettant en lumi\u00e8re l\u2019art chor\u00e9graphique. L\u2019application est intuitive, simple \u00e0 utiliser et permet de faire deux balades au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles en toute autonomie.\u00a0\r\n\r\n\u00c0 chaque \u00e9tape des parcours, une citation sur la danse appara\u00eet sur smartphone, r\u00e9v\u00e9lant une dimension po\u00e9tique, politique ou sociale de cet art du mouvement. Apr\u00e8s avoir positionn\u00e9 la citation en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 augment\u00e9e dans l\u2019espace qui les entoure, les participant.es ont acc\u00e8s \u00e0 un bonus li\u00e9 : vid\u00e9os d\u2019archives, invitations \u00e0 danser, explorations guid\u00e9es, cr\u00e9ations et anecdotes historiques...\r\n\r\nLa premi\u00e8re balade,\u00a0\"Pour commencer, tout en perception\"\u00a0se compose principalement d\u2019explorations guid\u00e9es qui mettent en \u00e9veil les sens afin d\u2019aborder l\u2019espace urbain de mani\u00e8re sensible.\u00a0De la rue de Flandre \u00e0 la Place de la Monnaie, en passant par l\u2019\u00e9glise du B\u00e9guinage, cette balade vous invite \u00e0 explorer les quartiers des Quais.\r\n\r\n> 1,6 km - dur\u00e9e entre 1h15 et 1h30 - facile d\u2019acc\u00e8s au d\u00e9part de Contredanse, rue de Flandre 46, 1000 Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nLa deuxi\u00e8me balade,\u00a0\"Alors on bouge\u00a0!\"\u00a0s\u2019inscrit davantage dans le mouvement. \u00c0 partir de partitions, de vid\u00e9os d\u2019archives, les participant.es sont invit\u00e9.es \u00e0 exp\u00e9rimenter la danse dans l\u2019espace public \u00e0 la mani\u00e8re de danseur.euses et chor\u00e9graphes qui ont marqu\u00e9 l\u2019histoire de la danse. De la Place des Martyrs \u00e0 la Place de la Monnaie, en passant par les jardins de la cit\u00e9 administrative, cette balade vous emm\u00e8ne dans les quartiers du Marais et des libert\u00e9s.\r\n\r\n> 2 km - dur\u00e9e entre 1h30 et 1h45 - petit d\u00e9nivel\u00e9 et escaliers au d\u00e9part de la Place des Martyrs, 1000 Bruxelles.\r\n\r\n\r\n1)T\u00e9l\u00e9chargez gratuitement l\u2019application\u00a0: \r\n\r\n> App Store\u00a0: https:\/\/apps.apple.com\/fr\/app\/si-ty-danses\/id1616615527\r\n\r\n> Play Store\u00a0: https:\/\/play.google.com\/store\/apps\/details?id=com.ArteamInteractive.BaladesUrbaines\r\n\r\n\r\n2) Baladez-vous\r\n\r\n> S\u00e9lectionnez la balade que vous souhaitez faire. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019outil de g\u00e9olocalisation, rejoignez l\u2019une des \u00e9tapes du parcours. Il est possible de commencer les balades de n\u2019importe quelle \u00e9tape mais nous vous conseillons vivement de commencer par la premi\u00e8re pour une meilleure exp\u00e9rience. \r\n\r\n> D\u00e9couvrez une anecdote sur le patrimoine \u00e0 chaque \u00e9tape et suivez l\u2019itin\u00e9raire trac\u00e9 sur la carte.\r\n\r\n\r\n3) Interagissez avec l\u2019espace urbain\r\n\r\n> Une fois arriv\u00e9.e \u00e0 l\u2019endroit indiqu\u00e9, une citation sur la danse ainsi qu\u2019une anecdote historique lui faisant \u00e9cho apparaissent dans l\u2019application.\r\n\r\n> Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 votre appareil photo, positionnez la citation en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 augment\u00e9e dans l\u2019espace qui vous entoure.\r\n\r\n> Enregistrez votre photo, modifiez-la si vous le souhaitez, pour d\u00e9bloquer le bonus.\r\n\r\n\r\n4) Profitez des bonus\r\n\r\n> Explorations guid\u00e9es, vid\u00e9os d\u2019archives, cr\u00e9ations et invitations \u00e0 danser, les bonus prennent des formes vari\u00e9es.  \r\n\r\n> Retrouvez tous les bonus d\u00e9bloqu\u00e9s dans la partie \u00ab galerie \u00bb de l\u2019application.","performers":"Un projet men\u00e9 par Anne Golaz avec Florence Corin, en collaboration avec Contredanse.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.sitydanses.be","email":"sitydanses@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537970"},"nl":{"name":"Si t\u2019y danses \u2013 balades urbaines","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537970"},"en":{"name":"Si t\u2019y danses \u2013 balades urbaines","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537970"},"de":{"name":"Si t\u2019y danses \u2013 balades urbaines","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537970"},"it":{"name":"Si t\u2019y danses \u2013 balades urbaines","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537970"},"sp":{"name":"Si t\u2019y danses \u2013 balades urbaines","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537970"},"pt":{"name":"Si t\u2019y danses \u2013 balades urbaines","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537970"},"cn":{"name":"Si t\u2019y danses \u2013 balades urbaines","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537970"}},"place":{"id":265996,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Bruxelles","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Bruxelles","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Bruxelles","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Bruxelles","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Bruxelles","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Bruxelles","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Bruxelles","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Bruxelles","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Bruxelles","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Bruxelles","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":nu