cr\u00e9atifs, proposant une programmation culturelle pluridisciplinaire, ainsi que des espaces \u00e0 la location. \r\n\r\nUn espace dynamique et convivial gr\u00e2ce aux synergies entre ses diff\u00e9rents occupants, mais aussi \u00e0 sa programmation \u00e0 la fois qualitative et d\u00e9cal\u00e9e.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"LaVall\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e Straat","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lavallee.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 491 71 43 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","address_line1":"Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e Straat, 39","address_line2":"1080 Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","description_web":"Deze voormalige industri\u00eble wasserij van 6.000 vierkante meter in Molenbeek is een ontmoetingsruimte die onderdak biedt aan een gemeenschap van kunstenaars en creatieve ondernemers, met een multidisciplinaire culturele programmatie en zaalverhuur. \r\n\r\nLaVall\u00e9e is een dynamische en gemoedelijke plek dankzij de kruisbestuivingen tussen de verschillende bewoners, maar ook dankzij de kwalitatieve en eigenzinnige programmering. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"LaVall\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e Street","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lavallee.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 491 71 43 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e Street, 39","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"LaVall\u00e9e, a 6 000 m\u00b2 former industrial laundry in Molenbeek, is a 'third place' that houses a community of artists and creative entrepreneurs, offering a multidisciplinary cultural programme, as well as spaces for rent. \r\n\r\nIt is