l":"micheldircken@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue de la Glaci\u00e8re, 18","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"CAF","address_street_name":"Rue de la Glaci\u00e8re","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":"micheldircken@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue de la Glaci\u00e8re, 18","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[7],"translations":{"fr":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"nl":["Sint-Gillis centrum"],"en":["Saint-Gilles Centre"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":19493,"location":{"lat":50.82255979,"lon":4.3515514},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-09-12T01:35:11+02:00","published_at":"2014-10-19T18:10:40+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":238111,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Bruxelles est fantastique ! Ce mus\u00e9e, l'un des plus atypique de Bruxelles, pr\u00e9sente des pi\u00e8ces de diff\u00e9rentes g\u00e9n\u00e9rations qui ont toutes un point commun avec le fantastique, l\u2019\u00e9trange ou le surr\u00e9alisme. Sa collection m\u00e9lange de nombreuses techniques et invite \u00e0 l\u2019imaginaire et au voyage. C\u2019est \u00e0 la mani\u00e8re d\u2019un cabinet de curiosit\u00e9s que le mus\u00e9e propose aux visiteurs une balade fantasque et unique. Pass\u00e9s \u00e0 la moulinette du troisi\u00e8me mill\u00e9naire, Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 ou Rops ne renieraient sans doute pas cet endroit fantasmagorique en plein coeur de Bruxelles !","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum voor Fantastische Kunst","address_street_name":"Amerikastraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Amerikastraat, 7","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Brussel is fantastisch! In een herenhuis in de Amerikaansestraat, op enkele stappen van het Hortamuseum, bevindt zich het Museum voor Fantastische Kunst. Het MAF kwam er op initiatief van Michel Dircken. De compleet atypische collectie ontsluit stukken van verschillende generaties die allemaal gerelateerd zijn aan de fantasiewereld, het bizarre of surrealisme, waarbij alle kunstvormen aan bod komen. Het staat buiten kijf dat kunstenaars als Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 of Rops deze plek nooit hadden willen missen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Fantastic Art Museum","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Brussels is fantastic! This museum, one of the most atypical of Brussels, presents pieces of different generations which all link to the fantastic, the strange or surrealism. Its collection mixes many techniques and invites on a journey through the imaginary. Conceived as a cabinet of curiosities, the museum is sure to offer visitors a fantastic and unique walkthrough. As would Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 or Rops, you will not be able to ignore this spooky place in the heart of Brussels!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Die st\u00e4ndige Sammlung des Museums f\u00fcr Fantastische Kunst umfasst Werke und Exponate aus unterschiedlichen Epochen, deren gemeinsamer Nenner das Fantastische, das Seltsame oder das Surrealistische ist. Diese absolut atypische Sammlung mischt s\u00e4mtliche Techniken: plastische Kunst, Malerei, Bildhauerei...","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","des