><\/iframe>","translations":{"fr":{"title":"Les miette entieret\u00e9"},"nl":{"title":"Les miette entieret\u00e9"},"en":{"title":"Les miette entieret\u00e9"}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-09-15","doors":"20:00:00","start":"21:00:00","end":"22:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-09-16","doors":"20:00:00","start":"21:00:00","end":"22:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-09-17","doors":"20:00:00","start":"21:00:00","end":"22:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-09-23","doors":"20:00:00","start":"21:00:00","end":"22:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-09-24","doors":"20:00:00","start":"21:00:00","end":"22:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-09-28","doors":"20:00:00","start":"21:00:00","end":"22:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-09-29","doors":"20:00:00","start":"21:00:00","end":"22:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-09-30","doors":"20:00:00","start":"21:00:00","end":"22:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-10-01","doors":"20:00:00","start":"21:00:00","end":"22:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":14},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Enfants"},"nl":{"name":"Kinderen"},"en":{"name":"Children"}},"value":7},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Jeunes"},"nl":{"name":"Jongeren"},"en":{"name":"Young people"}},"value":10},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Etudiants"},"nl":{"name":"Studenten"},"en":{"name":"Students"}},"value":10},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Seniors"},"nl":{"name":"Senioren"},"en":{"name":"Seniors"}},"value":12},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Demandeurs d'emploi"},"nl":{"name":"Werkzoekenden"},"en":{"name":"Job seekers"}},"value":10},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[263],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen"],"en":["Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-08-10T20:35:21+02:00","published_at":"2022-06-14T17:26:56+02:00","backoffice_id":255965,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.48999730502964},{"id":540065,"date_start":"2022-09-13","date_end":"2022-09-30","date_next":"2022-09-15","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[24,32],"translations":{"fr":["Galeries d'art","Design"],"nl":["Galeries","Design"],"en":["Art Galleries","Design"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["en","nl","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Finn Juhl design pour les collectionneurs d'art","shortdescr":"Husk Gallery \u2013 une galerie d\u2019art contemporain au Rivoli Bruxelles \u2013 pr\u00e9sente une exposition r\u00e9trospective sur l'\u0153uvre du designer danois Finn Juhl (1912-1989) \u00e0 l\u2019occasion de Design September en parall\u00e8le de son exposition avec l'artiste belge Peter Depelchin (\u00b01985).","longdescr":"Finn Juhl est devenu c\u00e9l\u00e8bre gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ses cr\u00e9ations innovatrices de mobilier dans lesquelles il a d\u00e9fi\u00e9 les concepts et m\u00e9thodes de production traditionnels. Il a dessin\u00e9 du mobilier en bois massif aux formes organiques s\u00e9duisantes gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son savoir-faire exceptionnel. Au milieu du 20\u00e8me si\u00e8cle, il \u00e9tait l'ambassadeur international du design danois. Afin de rendre hommage \u00e0 ce grand cr\u00e9ateur de meubles et designer, Husk Gallery propose des cr\u00e9ations qui sont influenc\u00e9es par l\u2019art contemporain de son \u00e9poque, et focalise sur son projet d\u2019int\u00e9rieur pour les collectionneurs d\u2019art, \u201cA study for an Art Collector\u201d de 1948. L'exposition est organis\u00e9e en collaboration avec Onecollection, un fabricant de meubles danois, qui d\u00e9tient depuis 2001 les droits exclusifs de fabrication de ses meubles, utilisant le label \u00ab House of Finn Juhl \u00bb et Designhus - le magasin sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9 en design nordique \u00e0 Tervuren. \u00c0 l\u2019occasion de Design September, Designhus organise une expo temporaire \u00e0 Bruxelles. Ensuite, Designhus pr\u00e9sente du 4 au 30 octobre dans son showroom \u00e0 Tervuren une plus grande s\u00e9lection des cr\u00e9ations ing\u00e9nieuses de Finn Juhl.","performers":"Pop-up Designhus @ Husk Gallery","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540065"},"nl":{"name":"Finn Juhl design voor kunstverzamelaars","shortdescr":"Husk Gallery - een promotiegalerie voor hedendaagse kunst in het Rivoligebouw te Brussel \u2013 zet ter gelegenheid van Brussels Design September 2022 de Deense designer Finn Juhl (1912-1989) in de kijker tijdens de expo met de Belgische kunstenaar Peter Depelchin (\u00b01985).","longdescr":"Finn Juhl verwierf bekendheid met zijn innovatieve meubelontwerpen waarbij traditionele concepten en productiemethoden uitgedaagd werden. Hij ontwierp voornamelijk massief houten meubilair met verleidelijke organische vormen tot stand gekomen dankzij superieur vakmanschap. In het midden van de 20ste eeuw was hij de internationale ambassadeur van het Deense design. Als hommage aan deze meubelarchitect en ontwerper, focust Husk Gallery op Finn Juhls meubelstukken die be\u00efnvloed werden door de beeldende kunst, alsook op \u201cA Study for an Art Collector\u201d, zijn interieurontwerp voor kunstverzamelaars uit 1948. De expo wordt georganiseerd i.s.m. Onecollection, een Deense meubelproducent die sinds 2001 de exclusieve rechten heeft om zijn meubelen te vervaardigen met het label \u2018House of Finn Juhl\u2019 en in samenwerking met Designhus - de speciaalzaak voor Scandinavisch design in Tervuren.  Designhus organiseert deze pop-up expo naar aanleiding van \u2018Brussels Design September\u2019. Vervolgens is van 4 tot 30 oktober 2022 in de Designhus showroom in het centrum van Tervuren nog een ruimere selectie van de vernuftige meubelontwerpen van Finn Juhl te zien.","performers":"Pop-up Designhus @ Husk Gallery","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 52 16 46","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540065"},"en":{"name":"Finn Juhl Design for Art Collectors","shortdescr":"Husk Gallery \u2013 a contemporary art gallery based in the Rivoli Buiding in Brussels \u2013 honours the Danish designer Finn Juhl (1912-1989) during its ongoing solo exhibition with Belgian artist Peter Depelchin (\u00b01985).","longdescr":"Finn Juhl is remembered as an innovative furniture designer, who challenged traditional thinking and production methods. He designed mainly solid wooden furniture with a seductive vocabulary of form and superlative craftsmanship. In the 1950s Finn Juhl acted as an international ambassador of Danish design. As a tribute to this furniture architect and designer, Husk Gallery presents a fine selection of Finn Juhl\u2019s furniture design pieces reflecting the contemporary art of his time, and highlights \u201cA Study for an Art Collector, Juhl\u2019s interior design project for art collectors presented in 1948. The exhibition is launched in collaboration with Onecollection, the Danish company who has the unique right to reproduce and sell his furniture under the label \u2018House of Finn Juhl\u2019 and Designhus - the hotspot for Nordic design in Tervuren. On the occasion of \u2018Design September\u2019 Designhus pops up with an exhibition in Brussels. Afterwards, Designhus  presents a larger selection of Finn Juhl\u2019s furniture design  in its Tervuren showroom from 4 to 30 October 2022.","performers":"Pop-up Designhus @ Husk Gallery","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540065"},"de":{"name":"Finn Juhl design voor kunstverzamelaars","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540065"},"it":{"name":"Finn Juhl design voor kunstverzamelaars","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540065"},"sp":{"name":"Finn Juhl design voor kunstverzamelaars","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540065"},"pt":{"name":"Finn Juhl design voor kunstverzamelaars","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540065"},"cn":{"name":"Finn Juhl design voor kunstverzamelaars","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/v