 het grote publiek plaatsvinden, zoals tentoonstellingen, modeshows of artistieke performances.  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"MAD Brussels is a Brussels\u2019 platform for gathering expertise from the city\u2019s Fashion and Design sectors. It aims to help with the promotion and development of Brussels stylists and designers and improve their exposure nationally and abroad.\r\n\r\nThe opening in April 2017 of their brand new, sparkling white headquarters marked something of a renaissance for the non-profit organisation, which can now multiply and combine its campaigns. It houses a ressource centre for professionals of the creative industries and related sectors, along with adaptable workspaces, meeting spaces, workshops, seminar rooms and a large space dedicated to public activities where multiple events are organised every year: exhibitions, fashion shows, artistic performances\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels ist eine Br\u00fcsseler Mode- und Designplattform, die sich der F\u00f6rderung, Unterst\u00fctzung und Begleitung der Br\u00fcsseler Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designern verschrieben hat, um sowohl landesweit als auch international ihre Reichweite zu erh\u00f6hen.\r\n\r\nDie Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen, komplett in Wei\u00df gehaltenen Geb\u00e4udes hat dem MAD Brussels noch einmal frischen Wind in den Segeln beschert. Hier befinden sich nicht nur Ressourcen f\u00fcr Vertreter der Kreativindustrie und damit zusammenh\u00e4ngenden Metiers, sondern auch vielf\u00e4ltig nutzbare Arbeitspl\u00e4tze und Orte der Begegnung. Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designer haben hier eine Anlaufstelle, gleichzeitig finden in den R\u00e4umen Ateliers, Workshops, Seminare, Ausstellungen, Modeschauen, Kunst-Performances statt\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels es una plataforma de Bruselas que reune expertos del los sectores de la moda y el dise\u00f1o. Tiene como objetivo ayudar en la promoci\u00f3n y el desarrollo de los dise\u00f1adores y estilistas de Bruselas y mejorar su imagen nacional e internacional.\r\nLa apertura de su novedosa y chispeante sede en abril de 2017 marc\u00f3 algo as\u00ed como el renacimiento para la organizaci\u00f3n sin \u00e1nimo de lucro, que ahora puede multiplicar y combinar sus campa\u00f1as. Posee un centro de recursos para profesionales de industrias culturales y sectores relacionados, junto con espacios de trabajo adaptados, lugares de reuni\u00f3n, talleres, seminarios y un gran espacio dedicado a actividades p\u00fablicas donde se organizan diversos eventos cada a\u00f1o: exhibiciones, desfiles de moda, representaciones art\u00edsticas\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":12629,"location":{"lat":50.85116098,"lon":4.34417