ided tours"}},"others":{"list":[103],"translations":{"fr":["Centre historique"],"nl":["Historisch centrum"],"en":["Historical Centre"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Heritage days @ mus\u00e9es Maison d\u2019\u00c9rasme & B\u00e9guinage","shortdescr":"Lors de cette r\u00e9ouverture avec visites guid\u00e9es, performances, concert et drink, vous pourrez d\u00e9couvrir le travail accompli pour rendre son allure d\u2019origine \u00e0 ce patrimoine architectural exceptionnel et unique en Europe.\r\nLa Maison d\u2019\u00c9rasme, quant \u00e0 elle, vous proposera un programme aux saveurs latines.","longdescr":"PROGRAMME > B\u00c9GUINAGE\r\nRue du Chapelain, 8\r\n\r\n> Visites guid\u00e9es \u00ab\u2009Le B\u00e9guinage d\u2019Anderlecht apr\u00e8s restauration\u2009\u00bb\r\nFR samedi \u00e0 11h30, 14h, 14h30 et 16h30 et dimanche \u00e0 11h30, 14h et 14h30\r\nNL samedi et dimanche \u00e0 11h30 et 14h30\r\nDur\u00e9e : 30 min.\r\n\r\n> Performance + concert + drink\r\nDimanche entre 15h et 18h\r\n\u2013 Performance de Coraline Guilbeau toutes les 20 minutes (en alternance FR\/NL)\r\n\u2013 Installation vid\u00e9o de Jivan van der Ende et An Onghena\r\nDur\u00e9e : 15 min.\r\n\u2013 Concert de Clara Levy (violon) \u00ab 13 visions \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s la compositrice Pauline Oliveros (1932-2016) et Hildegarde Von Bingen (1098-1179)\r\nEn collaboration avec \u00ab Les nuits du Beau Tas \u00bb\r\n\r\nPROGRAMME > MAISON D\u2019\u00c9RASME\r\nRue de Formanoir, 31\r\n\r\n> Atelier \u00ab\u2009D\u00e9couverte du latin vivant \u00bb\r\nFR\/NL Samedi et dimanche \u00e0 14h30 et 16h30\r\nLe latin, langue morte\u2009? A priori, on ne le parle plus beaucoup. A contrario, nos jeunes professeurs, Marion et Nicholas, parlent latin au quotidien. Ils vous apprendront au minimum \u00e0 vous pr\u00e9senter sans quiproquo et \u00e0 d\u00e9coder les adages chers \u00e0 \u00c9rasme, tel le fameux Festina Lente.\r\nDur\u00e9e : 45 min.\r\n\r\n> Visites guid\u00e9es \u00ab\u2009La Maison d\u2019\u00c9rasme et son jardin philosophique\u2009\u00bb\r\nFR samedi et dimanche \u00e0 10h30, 13h, 13h30 et 15h30\r\nNL samedi et dimanche \u00e0 10h30 et 13h30\r\nDur\u00e9e : 45 min.","performers":"- Guides du mus\u00e9e (visites guid\u00e9es)\r\n- Coraline Guilbeau (perfomance)\r\n- Jivan van der Ende en An Onghena (Video-installatie)\r\n- Clara Levy (concert)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum\/2022\/08\/1718-09-reouverture-beguinage-heritage-days\/","email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541346"},"nl":{"name":"Heritage Days @ Erasmushuis & begijnhofmusea","shortdescr":"Tijdens de heropening die gepaard zal gaan met rondleidingen, performances, een concert en drink, kunt u ontdekken wat voor een werk er werd verricht om aan dit uitzonderlijk architecturaal erfgoed \u2013 uniek in Europa \u2013 zijn oorspronkelijke allure terug te geven. Op zijn beurt komt het Erasmushuis met een Latijns getint programma.","longdescr":"PROGRAMMA > BEGIJNHOF\r\nKapelaanstraat 8\r\n\r\n> Rondleidingen \u00ab\u2009Het Begijnhof van Anderlecht na restauratie\u2009\u00bb\r\nFR zaterdag om 11.30 uur, 14.00 uur, 14.30 uur en 16.30 uur en zondag om 11.30 uur, 14.00 uur en 14.30 uur.\r\nNL zaterdag en zondag om 11.30 uur en 14.30 uur.\r\nDuur: 30 min.\r\n\r\n> Performance + concert + drink\r\nZondag tussen 15.00 uur en 18.00 uur\r\n\u2013 Performance door Coraline Guilbeau\r\nDe performance heeft plaats om de 20 minuten (afwisselend FR\/NL)\r\nDuur: 15 min.\r\n\u2013 Video-installatie van Jivan van der Ende en An Onghena\r\n\u2013 Concert met Clara Levy (viool) \u00ab 13 Visies \u00bb naar Pauline Oliveros (1932-2016) en Hildegarde Von Bingen (1098-1179)\r\nIn samenwerking met \u00ab Les nuits du Beau Tas \u00bb\r\n\r\nPROGRAMMA > ERASMUSHUIS\r\nDe Formanoirstraat 31\r\n\r\n> Workshop \u00ab\u2009Kennismaking met levend Latijn \u00bb\r\nFR\/NL Zaterdag en zondag om 14.30 uur en 16.30 uur\r\nIs Latijn een dode taal? A priori wordt het niet veel meer gesproken. Maar a contrario spreken onze jonge leraars Marion en Nicholas nog dagelijks Latijn. Ze laten je ad minimum zonder qui pro quo kennismaken met de adagia die Erasmus zo na aan het hart lagen en leren je ze te ontleden, zoals het bekende Festina Lente.\r\nDuur: 45 min.\r\n\r\n> Rondleidingen \u00ab\u2009Het Erasmushuis en zijn Filosofische Tuin\u2009\u00bb\r\nFR zaterdag en zondag om 10.30 uur, 13.00 uur, 13.30 uur en 15.30 uur\r\nNL zaterdag en zondag om 10.30 uur en 13.30 uur.\r\nDuur: 45 min.","performers":"- Museumsgids (rondleidingen)\r\n- Coraline Guilbeau (performance)\r\n- Jivan van der Ende en An Onghena (installation vid\u00e9o)\r\n- Clara Levy (concert)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum\/nl\/2022\/08\/1718-09-heropening-van-het-begijnhof-van-anderlecht-heritage-days\/","email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541346"},"en":{"name":"Heritage Days @ Erasmus House & Beguinage museums","shortdescr":"Upon the occasion of its re-opening, accompanied by guided tours, performances, a concert, and drinks, you will be able to discover the work done to restore its original appearance to this extraordinary heritage site unique in Europe. Erasmus House, for its part, will offer a programme with a Latin accent.","longdescr":"PROGRAMMING > BEGUINAGE\r\n\r\nRue du Chapelain 1070 Anderlecht\r\n\r\n> Guided tour: \u201cThe Anderlecht beguinage after restoration\u201d\r\nIn French: Saturday at 11.30 a.m., 2.00 p.m., 2.30 p.m. and 4.30 p.m. and Sunday at\r\n11.30 a.m., 2.00 p.m., and 2.30 p.m.\r\nIn Dutch: Saturday and Sunday at 11.30 a.m. and 2.30 p.m.\r\nLength: 30 min.\r\n\r\n> Performance + concert + drink\r\nSunday between 3 and 6 p.m.\r\n\u2013 Performance by Coraline Guilbeau.\r\nThe performance will take place every 20 minutes, alternating between French and Dutch.\r\nLength: 15 min.\r\n\u2013 Video installation by Jivan van der Ende and An Onghena.\r\n\u2013 Concert by Clara Levy (violon) \u201c13 visions\u201d, inspired by composer Pauline Oliveros (1932-2016) and the work of Hildegarde Von Bingen (1098-1179).\r\nIn conjunction with \u201cLes Nuits du Beau Tas\u201d.\r\n\r\nPROGRAMMING > ERASMUS HOUSE\r\nRue de Formanoir, 31, 1070 Anderlecht\r\n\r\n> Workshop: Discovering Living Latin\r\nSaturday and Sunday at 2.30 and 4.30 p.m. (bilingual in French & Dutch)\r\nIs Latin a dead language? A priori, it is no longer spoken much. A contrario, our young teachers, Marion and Nicholas, speak Latin daily. They will teach you at the very minimum to introduce yourself without a quid pro quo and to decipher the adages dear to Erasmus\u2019s heart, such as his famous festina lente.\r\nLength: 45 min.\r\n\r\n> Guided tour: \u201cErasmus House and its philosophical garden\u201d\r\nIn French: Saturday and Sunday at 10.30 a.m., 1.00 p.m., 1.30 p.m., and 3.30 p.m.\r\nIn Dutch: Saturday and Sunday at 10.30 a.m. and 1.30 p.m.","performers":"- Museum guides (guided tours)\r\n- Coraline Guilbeau (performance)\r\n- Jivan van der Ende en An Onghena (video installation)\r\n- Clara Levy (concert)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum\/en\/2022\/08\/1718-09-re-opening-of-the-anderlecht-beguinage-heritage-days\/","email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541346"},"de":{"name":"Heritage days @ mus\u00e9es Maison d\u2019\u00c9rasme & B\u00e9guinage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541346"},"it":{"name":"Heritage days @ mus\u00e9es Maison d\u2019\u00c9rasme & B\u00e9guinage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541346"},"sp":{"name":"Heritage days @ mus\u00e9es Maison d\u2019\u00c9rasme & B\u00e9guinage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541346"},"pt":{"name":"Heritage days @ mus\u00e9es Maison d\u2019\u00c9rasme & B\u00e9guinage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541346"},"cn":{"name":"Heritage days @ mus\u00e9es Maison d\u2019\u00c9rasme & B\u00e9guinage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541346"}},"place":{"id":8600,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"\u00c9rasme a s\u00e9journ\u00e9 en 1521 dans cette maison gothique (1450-1515) qui rassemble \u00e0\r\nla fois une collection de peintures, gravures et scuptures (Albrecht Du\u0308rer, Joos Van\r\nCleve, Pieter Huys, Cornelis Metsys, Frans Francken le Jeune \u2026), une biblioth\u00e8que\r\nsp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans les \u00e9ditions princeps, c\u2019est-\u00e0-dire les premi\u00e8res \u00e9ditions d\u2019une \u0153uvre\r\nchez diff\u00e9rents imprimeurs, un Jardin philosophique et un Jardin de plantes\r\nm\u00e9dicinales. Le mus\u00e9e publie des livres et organise des conf\u00e9rences, des concerts,\r\ndes expositions d\u2019art contemporain et historiques, des activit\u00e9s p\u00e9dagogiques, des\r\nvisites guid\u00e9es pour groupes.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Erasmushuis","address_street_name":"Formanoirstraat","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Formanoirstraat, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"In 1521 verbleef Erasmus in dit gotische huis (1450-1515) waar zich niet alleen een collectie bevindt van schilderijen, prenten en beeldhouwwerken (Albrecht Du\u0308rer, Joos\r\nVan Cleve, Pieter Huys, Cornelis Metsys, Frans Francken de Jongere\u2026), maar ook een\r\nbibliotheek gespecialiseerd in \u2018editiones principes\u2019, dat wil zeggen de eerste uitgaven\r\nvan een werk bij verschillende drukkers. Verder bevindt zich buiten nog een Filosofische\r\ntuin en een tuin met Geneeskrachtige planten.\r\nDaarnaast publiceert het museum boeken en organiseert voordrachten, concerten,\r\ntentoonstellingen met een historisch thema en tentoonstellingen Hedendaagse kunst,\r\npedagogische activiteiten en rondleidingen voor groepen.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Erasmus House","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"For several years, this house, which looks like a cloister, was home to the brilliant 16th-century humanist. Works of art, engravings, books, and archives bear witness to life in that era. End your visit in the philosophical and medicinal garden.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Museum des Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"Das \u201eMaison d\u2019Erasme\u201c in der Br\u00fcsseler Gemeinde Anderlecht wurde Ende des 15. Jahrhunderts im Auftrag eines Stiftsherrn der nahegelegenen Stiftskirche St. Peter und St. Guido  im sp\u00e4tgotischen Stil errichtet.\r\n\r\nDas Haus beherbergte im Jahr 1521 den bedeutenden niederl\u00e4ndischen Gelehrten des Renaissance-Humanismus Erasmus von Rotterdam, der hier, fernab von den gro\u00dfen Machtzentren und den dort herrschenden Religionskriegen, die Ruhe und Abgeschiedenheit der Natur suchte.\r\n\r\nDas im Maison d\u2019Erasme untergebrachte Museum zeigt sowohl eine Gem\u00e4ldesammlung mit Werken von Holbein, Bosch und Metsys als auch eine reich mit alten B\u00fccherausgaben best\u00fcckte Bibliothek. Der umliegende Garten besteht aus einem \u201eJardin des Maladies\u201c \u2013 dem \u201eGarten der Krankheiten\u201c mit zahlreichen Heilpflanzen \u2013 und einem \u201eJardin philosophique\u201c \u2013 dem \u201ePhilosophischen Garten\u201c.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Casa di Erasmo","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"La Casa di Erasmo deve il suo nome e la sua fama ad Erasmo da Rotterdam, che vi soggiorn\u00f2 nel 1521. Divenuta un museo dedicato al grande umanista rinascimentale, \u00e8 luogo di esposizione di una collezione unica composta da opere d'arte - sculture e dipinti di maestri fiamminghi -, mobili e libri antichi, molti dei quali scritti dallo stesso Erasmo. Se la Casa di Erasmo \u00e8 una delle pi\u00f9 antiche di Bruxelles - costruita in tre fasi nel corso dei secoli XV e XVI -, nel 1932 \u00e8 stata oggetto di un restauro completo voluto, nello spirito del pi\u00f9 puro storicismo, da Daniel Van Damme, fondatore del museo, con l'aiuto dell'architetto Charles Van Elst, che costru\u00ec anche la casa di Maurice Car\u00eame.  Gli spazi interni sono stati poi riconvertiti in sale del museo. Queste sono state decorate (una stanza con le pareti completamente rivestite di sontuose pelli di Cordoba) ed arredate con mobili provenienti dall'antica collezione del Ministro Vandenpeereboom. Gli interni sono quindi ricostruzioni con lo scopo di dare ai visitatori un'idea di quello che poteva essere una residenza rinascimentale. Le ricostruzioni sono in parte basate su documenti storici (lo studio di Erasmo che d\u00e0 sul giardino) ed in parte su ritrovamenti archeologici quali lo splendido fregio affrescato del primo piano. Nella parte posteriore della casa, un ampio giardino ombreggiato da grandi alberi conserva alcuni resti archeologici dell'antico castello di Anderlecht, poeticamente abbinati a diverse installazioni di artisti contemporanei. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Casa de Erasmo","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"La Casa de Erasmo debe su nombre y prestigio a la temporada que pas\u00f3 en ella Erasmo de R\u00f3terdam en 1521. Convertida en un museo dedicado a este gran humanista del Renacimiento, es el envoltorio de una colecci\u00f3n \u00fanica compuesta por obras de arte (esculturas y pinturas de maestros flamencos), muebles y libros antiguos, entre ellos numerosas ediciones erasmianas. Si la Casa de Erasmo es una de las m\u00e1s antiguas de Bruselas (construida en tres fases a lo largo de los siglos XV y XVI), a partir de 1932 fue objeto de una restauraci\u00f3n completa llevada a cabo, en el m\u00e1s puro historicismo, por Daniel Van Damme, fundador del museo, con la ayuda del arquitecto Charles Van Elst, que tambi\u00e9n construy\u00f3 la casa de Maurice Car\u00eame. Los espacios interiores se reorganizaron entonces en salas de museo que fueron decoradas (entre ellas, una sala con las paredes totalmente cubiertas por suntuosas pieles de C\u00f3rdoba) y amuebladas con mobiliario procedente de la antigua colecci\u00f3n del ministro Vandenpeereboom. El interior es, por tanto, una reproducci\u00f3n cuyo fin es dar a los visitantes la idea de lo que podr\u00eda haber sido una residencia en el Renacimiento, basada en parte en documentos hist\u00f3ricos (despacho de Erasmo frente al jard\u00edn) y en hallazgos arqueol\u00f3gicos como el maravilloso friso pintado al fresco del primer piso. Detr\u00e1s de la casa, un vasto jard\u00edn con grandes \u00e1rboles que le dan sombra conserva algunos restos arqueol\u00f3gicos del antiguo castillo de Anderlecht, los cuales se encuentran, po\u00e9ticamente, cerca de varias instalaciones de artistas contempor\u00e1neos. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":327,"location":{"lat":50.83592263,"lon":4.3077579},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-09-08T15:35:42+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:26+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":8600,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"\u00c9rasme a s\u00e9journ\u00e9 en 1521 dans cette maison gothique (1450-1515) qui rassemble \u00e0\r\nla fois une collection de peintures, gravures et scuptures (Albrecht Du\u0308rer, Joos Van\r\nCleve, Pieter Huys, Cornelis Metsys, Frans Francken le Jeune \u2026), une biblioth\u00e8que\r\nsp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans les \u00e9ditions princeps, c\u2019est-\u00e0-dire les premi\u00e8res \u00e9ditions d\u2019une \u0153uvre\r\nchez diff\u00e9rents imprimeurs, un Jardin philosophique et un Jardin de plantes\r\nm\u00e9dicinales. Le mus\u00e9e publie des livres et organise des conf\u00e9rences, des concerts,\r\ndes expositions d\u2019art contemporain et historiques, des activit\u00e9s p\u00e9dagogiques, des\r\nvisites guid\u00e9es pour groupes.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Erasmushuis","address_street_name":"Formanoirstraat","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Formanoirstraat, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"In 1521 verbleef Erasmus in dit gotische huis (1450-1515) waar zich niet alleen een collectie bevindt van schilderijen, prenten en beeldhouwwerken (Albrecht Du\u0308rer, Joos\r\nVan Cleve, Pieter Huys, Cornelis Metsys, Frans Francken de Jongere\u2026), maar ook een\r\nbibliotheek gespecialiseerd in \u2018editiones principes\u2019, dat wil zeggen de eerste uitgaven\r\nvan een werk bij verschillende drukkers. Verder bevindt zich buiten nog een Filosofische\r\ntuin en een tuin met Geneeskrachtige planten.\r\nDaarnaast publiceert het museum boeken en organiseert voordrachten, concerten,\r\ntentoonstellingen met een historisch thema en tentoonstellingen Hedendaagse kunst,\r\npedagogische activiteiten en rondleidingen voor groepen.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Erasmus House","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"For several years, this house, which looks like a cloister, was home to the brilliant 16th-century humanist. Works of art, engravings, books, and archives bear witness to life in that era. End your visit in the philosophical and medicinal garden.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Museum des Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"Das \u201eMaison d\u2019Erasme\u201c in der Br\u00fcsseler Gemeinde Anderlecht wurde Ende des 15. Jahrhunderts im Auftrag eines Stiftsherrn der nahegelegenen Stiftskirche St. Peter und St. Guido  im sp\u00e4tgotischen Stil errichtet.\r\n\r\nDas Haus beherbergte im Jahr 1521 den bedeutenden niederl\u00e4ndischen Gelehrten des Renaissance-Humanismus Erasmus von Rotterdam, der hier, fernab von den gro\u00dfen Machtzentren und den dort herrschenden Religionskriegen, die Ruhe und Abgeschiedenheit der Natur suchte.\r\n\r\nDas im Maison d\u2019Erasme untergebrachte Museum zeigt sowohl eine Gem\u00e4ldesammlung mit Werken von Holbein, Bosch und Metsys als auch eine reich mit alten B\u00fccherausgaben best\u00fcckte Bibliothek. Der umliegende Garten besteht aus einem \u201eJardin des Maladies\u201c \u2013 dem \u201eGarten der Krankheiten\u201c mit zahlreichen Heilpflanzen \u2013 und einem \u201eJardin philosophique\u201c \u2013 dem \u201ePhilosophischen Garten\u201c.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Casa di Erasmo","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"La Casa di Erasmo deve il suo nome e la sua fama ad Erasmo da Rotterdam, che vi soggiorn\u00f2 nel 1521. Divenuta un museo dedicato al grande umanista rinascimentale, \u00e8 luogo di esposizione di una collezione unica composta da opere d'arte - sculture e dipinti di maestri fiamminghi -, mobili e libri antichi, molti dei quali scritti dallo stesso Erasmo. Se la Casa di Erasmo \u00e8 una delle pi\u00f9 antiche di Bruxelles - costruita in tre fasi nel corso dei secoli XV e XVI -, nel 1932 \u00e8 stata oggetto di un restauro completo voluto, nello spirito del pi\u00f9 puro storicismo, da Daniel Van Damme, fondatore del museo, con l'aiuto dell'architetto Charles Van Elst, che costru\u00ec anche la casa di Maurice Car\u00eame.  Gli spazi interni sono stati poi riconvertiti in sale del museo. Queste sono state decorate (una stanza con le pareti completamente rivestite di sontuose pelli di Cordoba) ed arredate con mobili provenienti dall'antica collezione del Ministro Vandenpeereboom. Gli interni sono quindi ricostruzioni con lo scopo di dare ai visitatori un'idea di quello che poteva essere una residenza rinascimentale. Le ricostruzioni sono in parte basate su documenti storici (lo studio di Erasmo che d\u00e0 sul giardino) ed in parte su ritrovamenti archeologici quali lo splendido fregio affrescato del primo piano. Nella parte posteriore della casa, un ampio giardino ombreggiato da grandi alberi conserva alcuni resti archeologici dell'antico castello di Anderlecht, poeticamente abbinati a diverse installazioni di artisti contemporanei. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Casa de Erasmo","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"La Casa de Erasmo debe su nombre y prestigio a la temporada que pas\u00f3 en ella Erasmo de R\u00f3terdam en 1521. Convertida en un museo dedicado a este gran humanista del Renacimiento, es el envoltorio de una colecci\u00f3n \u00fanica compuesta por obras de arte (esculturas y pinturas de maestros flamencos), muebles y libros antiguos, entre ellos numerosas ediciones erasmianas. Si la Casa de Erasmo es una de las m\u00e1s antiguas de Bruselas (construida en tres fases a lo largo de los siglos XV y XVI), a partir de 1932 fue objeto de una restauraci\u00f3n completa llevada a cabo, en el m\u00e1s puro historicismo, por Daniel Van Damme, fundador del museo, con la ayuda del arquitecto Charles Van Elst, que tambi\u00e9n construy\u00f3 la casa de Maurice Car\u00eame. Los espacios interiores se reorganizaron entonces en salas de museo que fueron decoradas (entre ellas, una sala con las paredes totalmente cubiertas por suntuosas pieles de C\u00f3rdoba) y amuebladas con mobiliario procedente de la antigua colecci\u00f3n del ministro Vandenpeereboom. El interior es, por tanto, una reproducci\u00f3n cuyo fin es dar a los visitantes la idea de lo que podr\u00eda haber sido una residencia en el Renacimiento, basada en parte en documentos hist\u00f3ricos (despacho de Erasmo frente al jard\u00edn) y en hallazgos arqueol\u00f3gicos como el maravilloso friso pintado al fresco del primer piso. Detr\u00e1s de la casa, un vasto jard\u00edn con grandes \u00e1rboles que le dan sombra conserva algunos restos arqueol\u00f3gicos del antiguo castillo de Anderlecht, los cuales se encuentran, po\u00e9ticamente, cerca de varias instalaciones de artistas contempor\u00e1neos. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":327,"location":{"lat":50.83592263,"lon":4.3077579},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-09-08T15:35:42+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:26+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/63ca893d8248c0a138d16cdd0a0d91a4e85d38fd.jpg","width":899,"height":899,"ratio":1,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Heritage days @ mus\u00e9es M