 accueille des activit\u00e9s culturelles, notamment des concerts (classiques, jazz...), des expositions et des conf\u00e9rences. T\u00e9moin du pass\u00e9 rural de Bruxelles avec ses origines remontant au XIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle, elle est un tr\u00e9sor unique de notre patrimoine culturel.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"La Ferme Rose","address_street_name":"De Fr\u00e9laan","address_street_number":"44","address_street_box":null,"email":"lafermerose.asbl@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/lafermerose-uccle.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 375 71 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Ukkel","address_line1":"De Fr\u00e9laan, 44","address_line2":"1180 Ukkel","description_web":"La Ferme Rose werd prachtig gerenoveerd, met oog voor de authentieke charme van het gebouw. Er worden culturele activiteiten georganiseerd, zoals concerten (klassiek, jazz...), tentoonstellingen en conferenties. Het gebouw geeft blijk van het Brusselse, rurale verleden en kent zijn oorsprong in de 13de eeuw, wat het een unieke schat van ons cultureel erfgoed maakt.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"La Ferme Rose","address_street_name":"Avenue De Fr\u00e9","address_street_number":"44","address_street_box":null,"email":"lafermerose.asbl@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/lafermerose-uccle.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 375 71 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue De Fr\u00e9, 44","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Beautifully renovated, yet retaining the charm of its ancestor, the Ferme Rose hosts cultural activities such as concerts (classical, jazz...), exhibitions and conferences. It is evidence of Brussels' rural past, with its origins dating back to the 13th century, and is a unique treasure of our cultural heritage.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_v