8s de sa famille ou de ses plus proches amis, chacun conserve dans son jardin secret le plus embarrassant, l\u2019inavouable, le pire.\r\nPourtant, l\u2019heure des confidences est arriv\u00e9e. \r\nDans ce spectacle improvis\u00e9, un des personnages aura un secret. \r\nCe secret, c\u2019est vous qui le choisirez. \r\n A lui ensuite de passer aux aveux \u2026 \u00bb \r\n\r\n\r\n Spectacle d'improvisation (tout public) jou\u00e9 par : \r\n- Vincent Doms \r\n- Laurie Andrieu \r\n- Bertrand Daine","performers":"Vincent Doms, \r\nBertrand Daine, \r\nS\u00e9verine De Witte, \r\nLaurie Andrieu","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.letrac.be\/reservation","email":"info@letrac.be","phone_contact":"+32 470 50 04 75","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540418"},"nl":{"name":"* Confidences * - Spectacle d'improvisation de V. Doms, B. Daine, S. De Witte & L. Andrieu","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540418"},"en":{"name":"* Confidences * - Spectacle d'improvisation de V. Doms, B. Daine, S. De Witte & L. Andrieu","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540418"},"de":{"name":"CONFIDENCES - Spectacle d'improvisation de V. Doms, B. Daine & L. Andrieu","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540418"},"it":{"name":"CONFIDENCES - Spectacle d'improvisation de V. Doms, B. Daine & L. Andrieu","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email