s. \r\nPaiement ? Pour confirmer votre inscription, veuillez effectuer le paiement par virement bancaire sur le compte de l'association: La Table Ronde de l'Architecture asbl - Banque Triodos IBAN: BE18 5230 8128 5065 BIC\/SWIFT: TRIOBEBB \u200bCommunication: \"cours dessin - nom et pr\u00e9nom\".\r\nLangue ? Les ateliers sont donn\u00e9s en fran\u00e7ais et en anglais. \r\nLe mat\u00e9riel ? le mat\u00e9riel est compris dans le prix. \r\nChangement de date ou annulation ? Un changement de date est autoris\u00e9 si le cours n'est pas complet. Un changement de date ou un remboursement sera appliqu\u00e9 dans le cas o\u00f9 l'\u00e9cole annule le cours ou sur pr\u00e9sentation d'un certificat m\u00e9dical.\r\n\r\nInfos, r\u00e9servations\u00a0: contact@latablerondearchitecture.com","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.latablerondearchitecture.com","email":"contact@latablerondearchitecture.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540112"},"nl":{"name":"Teken- en schildercursus","shortdescr":"Teken- en schildercursus \/ Architectuur en natuur","longdescr":"Drie woensdagen van 14u tot 16u : 28.09 , 26.10 & 30.11.2022.\r\n\r\nPRAKTISCHE INFORMATIE :\r\nWie kan deelnemen ? De cursussen staan open voor iedereen vanaf 14 jaar. \r\nPrijs ? 105 \u20ac voor de drie cursussen van twee uur. \r\nBetaling ? Om uw inschrijving te bevestigen, gelieve de betaling per overschrijving op de rekening van de vereniging uit te voeren: La Table Ronde de l'Architecture vzw - Triodos Bank IBAN: BE18 5230 8128 5065 BIC\/SWIFT: TRIOBEBB Mededeling: \"cours dessin - nom et pr\u00e9nom\". \r\nTaal ? De workshops worden gegeven in het Frans en het Engels. \r\nMaterialen ? materialen zijn inbegrepen in de prijs. \r\nVerandering van datum of annulering ? Een wijziging van de datum is mogelijk indien de cursus niet vol is. Als de school de cursus annuleert of op vertoon van een medische verklaring, wordt een andere datum vastgesteld of wordt restitutie verleend.\r\n\r\nInfo & plaatsbespreking : contact@latablerondearchitecture.com","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.latablerondearchitecture.com","email":"contact@latablerondearchitecture.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540112"},"en":{"name":"Cours de dessin et de peinture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540112"},"de":{"name":"Cours de dessin et de peinture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540112"},"it":{"name":"Cours de dessin et de peinture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540112"},"sp":{"name":"Cours de dessin et de peinture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540112"},"pt":{"name":"Cours de dessin et de peinture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540112"},"cn":{"name":"Cours de dessin et de peinture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540112"}},"place":{"id":753,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Charlier","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Le mus\u00e9e, inaugur\u00e9 en 1928, est comme un tableau d\u2019\u00e9poque\u2026 on se retrouve au temps de La Libre Esth\u00e9tique et du Groupe des 20. Les collections sont expos\u00e9es dans les salons, riches en mobilier et objets d\u2019art d\u00e9coratifs d\u2019\u00e9poque Louis XV, Louis XVI et Empire.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Charliermuseum","address_street_name":"Kunstlaan","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Kunstlaan, 16","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"Het museum, geopend in 1928, is gevestigd in het prive-herenhuis van de beeldhouwer Guillaume Charlier, dat dateert uit de 19e eeuw. Het richt zich op de Belgische schilderkunst van eind 19e tot begin 20e eeuw. De collecties worden getoond in de salons, rijkelijk voorzien van decoratieve stukken uit de Louis XV, Louis XVI en Empire periodes.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Charlier Museum","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"The museum is based in the private mansion, dating from the 19th century, of the sculptor Guillaume Charlier. It focuses on Belgian painting from the late 19th to the early 20th century. Its art exhibitions take place in a setting of lavish furnishings, with numerous decorative pieces from the Louis XV, Louis XVI, and Empire periods.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Charlier","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Das 1928 eingeweihte Museum ist wie ein Gem\u00e4lde der Epoche... man findet sich in der Zeit der La Libre Est\u00e9tique und der Groupe des 20 wieder. Die Sammlungen werden in den reich mit Mobiliar und historischen Dekorationsgegenst\u00e4nden (Louis XV, Louis XV und Empire) best\u00fcckten Salons ausgestellt.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Charlier","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Charlier","ad